<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">36 - Ngulu Bible Version AYUB- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">AYUBU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ayu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha Ayubu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayu imt ULONGOELO Kitabu iki chasimuila mbuli za mnt'hu yumwenga mhuwilwa akwitangwa Ayubu, uyo asulumilaga vitendese naho hadamanye wavu kwa kumlabila Mnungu (Ayubu 1:22). Hehali amanyize niani awandikaga kitabu cha Ayubu, hegu nekiwandikwa ini mna yadahika kugamba Ayubu ekalaga mwo lupisi lwa Ibulahimu, kwaviya wikazi wakwe mwenye ekalaga miyaka gana dimwenga na milongo mine. Wamanyi hawafanyanyaga kugamba Ayubu niye awandikaga kitabu iki. Mwandisi mtuhu heekumanyika aonaga ni vedi awagambile want'hu watuhu simulizi izi za Ayubu na kuziwandika.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Ayubu ni cha masulumizo, mwavu alekelagwa ni Mnungu kumtenda Ayubu asulumile, kwaviya idyo afanyanyaga kugamba masulumizo ayo nayamtende Ayubu amleke kumvika Mnungu (Ayubu 1:12). Nt'hendelo nk'hulu ye kitabu cha Ayubu chasimwiila milosi ya Ayubu na wambwiyaze, kwaviya nii Ayubu asulumilaga. Wambwiya wa Ayubu wahuwila kugamba Ayubu andaga akasulumila kwaviya yo uwihi uwo audamanye, mna Ayubu ahuwilaga kugamba nakanda hana masa. Mwo kwajika ayo Mnungu alonga na Ayubu mna hakumgambila nii nakasulumila viya. Ayubu eze abunk'hule kugamba Mnungu adaha kudamanya kila kint'hu icho akuunga, na kugamba mnt'hu hakudaha kumanya udamanyi wa kwehela wa Mnungu, Ayubu avikilwa naho ni Mnungu kwa ugoli na wana wabindile wingi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeli mndani</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbuli izo zatendaga Ayubu asulumile izo zatendagwa nu mwavu msafa wa bosi na wa kaidi</para>
  <para style="io1">Ayubu andaga akalonga na wambwiyaze mwa masulumizo yakwe msafa wa katatu kubula 37.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mnungu alonga na Ayubu na Ayubu ahitula mwe msafa wa 38 kubula 42: 6.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mwo wikazi wose wa Ayubu na ivo Mnungu amvikilaga mwo masulumizo yakwe msafa wa 42: 7-17.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Mwavu amgeza Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga mwe isi ya Usi zina dyakwe etangagwa Ayubu. Mnt'hu uyo andaga ywedi naho mhuwila, andaga akamvika Mnungu naho haungaga kudamanya yaihle. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Ayubu andaga na wana kilume mfungate na wanakike watatu, <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />naho andaga na ngoto alufu mfungate na ngamia alufu nt'hatu na ng'ombe alufu imwenga zo kulima na mp'hunda magana mashano naho andaga na wandima wabindile wingi, yehe andaga mgoli mkulu vitendese kujink'ha want'hu wose uko ulailo wa zuwa.<verse eid="JOB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Wanawe wandaga na kihendo cha kulalikana cho kudya na kunywa mwe zinyumba zawe kila yumwenga kwa zuwa dyakwe, wandaga wakawawalalika walumbu zawe watatu vileke weze wadye no kunywa hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Kila wakabinda zuwa dya kinyemi, Ayubu awetangaga wanawe vileke awakukize. Enukaga mtondo tondo umwo zuwa dya kinyemi dize disile, alavaga nt'hambiko yo kokwa kwajili ya kila yumwenga wawe kwaviya afanyanyaga kugamba vadahika wanangu wadamanyaga wavu naho wafanyanyaga yaihile mwa Mnungu mwe mioyo yawe. Ino Yandaga ni kihendo kwa Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Zuwa dimwenga watumigwa wa kwe mbingu waduganaga ho undiilo wa Zumbe Mnungu. Mwavu naye ezaga niyo anda hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Zumbe Mnungu amuuzaga Mwavu, “Walawahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Mwavu naye niyo amhitula, “Nalawa mwo kugenda genda na kuzungulukazunguluka mwe isi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba Mwavu, “Togola kumwona mndima ywangu Ayubu? Mwe isi yose hahana mtuhu eli enga yehe. Yehe ni mnt'hu ywedi akunivika miye naho hakuunga kudamanya yaihile.”<verse eid="JOB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Mwavu niyo amhitula Zumbe Mnungu, “Togola Ayubu akuvika weye haheina kint'hu? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Weye kumwamila nt'hendelo zose yehe hamwenga na nyumba yakwe na kila kint'hu icho ananacho, kumvikila ugoli wakwe ugenyela mwe isi yose. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Mna haluse mhoke vint'hu vose ivo ananavo, uone uneva hakuhomole mwe kiyeti!”<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba mwavu, “Aya wadaha kudamanya chochose icho ukudaha mwa uwo ugoli wakwe mna yehe mwenye usekumlumiza.” Ivo Mwavu ahalawaga ho undiilo wa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Ayubu na ugoli wakwe wabanangwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Zuwa dimwenga wana wa Ayubu umwo wandaga wakadya no kunywa divai mwe nyumba ya nduguye mkulu, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />mndima ywakwe yumwenga ezaga kwa Ayubu akaguluka na kumgamba, “Chandaga kikalima kwa ng'ombe, mp'hunda zako nazo zandaga aho hagihi zikadya. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Aaho Waseba wawatowaga na kuiguha mifugwa na kuwakoma wandima kwa sime. Hihona miye nikedu hiza kukwigaila ulosi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Umwo akanda agendeela kulonga, mwigala ulosi mtuhu ezaga niyo agamba, “Lumwemwe lwaseelaga kulawa kwo ulanga niyo woka ngoto na wadimi, ni miye nikedu nihonile kukwigaila ulosi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Uyo naye umwo akanda akagendeela kulonga, mwigala ulosi mtuhu naye ezaga niyo agamba, “Mafyo matatu ya Wakalidayo yakikump'hukilaga na kuzitaha zingamia zako. Naho wawakomaga wadimi wako kwa sime. Ni miye nikedu nihonile kukwigaila ulosi!”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Umwo akanda akei kubinda kulonga, ezaga mwigala ulosi mtuhu naho niyo agamba, “Wana wako wose we kilume na wanakike wandaga wakadya no kunywa mwe nyumba ya nduguye yawe mkulu, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />aaho niyo kwalaila nk'hung'unt'ho kulawa kwe dijangwa, yaitowaga nyumba iyo mwe mp'hembe nne niyo yagwa, naho wana wose wabanikaga, ni miye nikedu nihonile kukwigaila ulosi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Aho Ayubu niyo akimala, atatulaga mavalo yakwe na kuzimoga fili zakwe, niyo akeduula hasi na kumvika Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />Niyo agamba, “Nelekagwa hina kint'hu name nenihauke hina kint'hu, Zumbe Mnungu anink'haga naho kaviguha, zina dyakwe ditogolwe!”<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Mwe mbuli izi zose Ayubu hadamanye wavu naho hafanyanye kugamba Mnungu kamdamanyila yaihile.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Mwavu amgeza naho Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Zuwa tuhu naho, watumigwa ywa kwe mbingu weze wadugane ho undiilo wa Zumbe Mnungu, Mwavu naye alailaga aaho hameso hawe. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Zumbe Mnungu amuuzaga Mwavu, “Walawahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Mwavu niyo amhitula, “Nalawa mwo kugendagenda na kuzungulukazunguluka mwe isi.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo amuuza Mwavu, “Togola kumwona mndima ywangu Ayubu? Hahana hata yumwenga mwe isi eli enga yehe. Yehe ni mnt'hu mhuwila naho ni ywedi. Anivika miye naho hakuunga kudamanya yaihile. Naye mpaka ivi haluse kanda mhuwila mna weye kuniluvya nimtendele yaihile haheina masa yeyose.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Mwavu niyo amhitula, “Kwafya umwili wakwe! Kwaviya mnt'hu naalave kila kint'hu icho ananacho kwajili yo ugima wakwe. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Haluse mtende ande na usungu mkulu mwo mwili wakwe, naye kwa kindedi naakuhomole!”<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu amgambaga Mwavu, “Haya, wadaha kumdamanyila vovose ivo ukuunga, mna usekumkoma.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Ivo Mwavu ahalawaga hameso ha Zumbe Mnungu, naye amsulumizaga Ayubu kwa kumwink'ha maihu yaihile yatumbukaga niyo yanda nk'wenge mwo mwili wakwe wose. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Niho Ayubu aguhaga kazae na kukekuluguta mwo mwili wakwe wose uku akanda kekala mwe maivu.<verse eid="JOB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Aaho mkaziwe niyo amgamba, “Togola ukei du wamhuwila Mnungu ywako? Mhomole Mnungu vileke ubanike!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Ayubu niyo amhitula mkaziwe, “Weye walonga enga yumwenga mwa awo wavele wahezi. Togola waunga kipate ayedi du kulawa kwa Mnungu? Kwajili yani kilemele kuhokela yaihile kulawa kwakwe?” Mwe mbuli izo zose Ayubu hadamanyaga wavu kwa kulonga kwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambuyaze watatu Ayubu wamtalakila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Ivo wambuyaze watatu Ayubu, Elifazi kulawa isi ya Temani na Bilidadi kulawa isi ya Shua na Sofali kulawa isi ya Naamati, wevaga mbuli ziihile mwa ayo yose yampatile Ayubu, wezaga vileke wamsangalaze mwa ayo makunt'ho apatile. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Umwo weze wamuone kwa hale wandaga hawammanyize kugamba ni yehe. Ivo weze wamuone kwa hagihi wakongaga kuila kwa kugutila naho watatulaga suke zawe na kutimula sanga kulanga na kukegela mwe mitwi yawe. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Ivo wekalaga hasi hamwenga na Ayubu kwa mazuwa mfungate kilo no msi, haheina kumgambila mbuli yeyose kwaviya waonaga masulumizo yakwe yandaga ni makulu vitendese.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amlabila Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Umwo yeze yajike ayo Ayubu akongaga kulonga akaligita dizuwa dyo kwelekwa kwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Ayubu niyo agamba, <verse eid="JOB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />zuwa dyo kwelekwa kwangu diligitwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">na kilo kiya chalongagwa kuna ubovu wa mwana kilume.<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Zuwa idyo hegu dyahitulwe dinde ziza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">Zuwa idyo hegu dyagile hata houndiilo wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">naho ung'azi usekudilangazila.<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Zuwa idyo hegu dyasigale mwe kizuli cha ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">vunde titu digubike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">ziza dya nomsi diditise.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Naho kilo icho hegu dyahauswe vitendese, hegu disekuwazwa mwe dizuwa dyo mwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">hegu usekuwazwa mwe dizuwa dyo mnenge wowose.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Kilo icho mvele yeyose asekuinula nda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">izwi dya kinyemi disekwivika mndani mwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Wagambileni wasai wadiligite zuwa idyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">Wadya wakumanya kumwitanga Lewiyasani vileke adikump'hukile zuwa idyo.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Kilo icho nt'hondo zakwe zinde ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">zizungule ung'azi mna zisekuupata</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">naho zisekuona ung'azi hata uneva kucha.<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />Zuwa idyo diligitwe kwa kunitenda nelekwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">hegu kwa kunitenda niyaone makunt'ho.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Nii hyelekwe handa hibanika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">Nimbwai hibanike umwo nandile halawa mwe inda?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Nii mnala akanigata?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">Naho nii akanonk'heza?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Nabanike mwo lupisi ulwo hegu nehihumula kwa utondowazi,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />hegu nagonile enga maseuta ne vilongozi we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">awo wazengega mazumba, ivi haluse yenda mahame,<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />naho hegu nagonile enga wana seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">awo wamemezaga zahabu na masawa mwe zinyumba zawe.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Hegu nii himoselwe msanga enga katiti kabanikile kwe inda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">naho enga kank'henya hakaone ungazi?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Uko kwe isi ya wabanike want'hu waihile waleka nk'huswank'huswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">naho uko wasokele wahumula.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Uko wavugailwa wana kinyemi kwa hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">hawakutegeleza naho maizwi ya wakimalizi wawe.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Wagoli kwa wakiwa weyuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">naho watumwa nawalekelwa kulawa kwa wakulu wawe.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Nii ung'azi wang'ala kwa wadya wendile mwe makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">na wadya wata usungu wenk'higwa ugima?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />Wakugojela kubanika mna hawakubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">Wadya wakuzungula kubanika kujink'ha kindolo kifisigwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Awo nawande na kinyemi, na kwanga umwo wanabula mwe kikuta.<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Nii nigendeele kunda mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">na miye hikuona sila ya kuhinga.<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Hant'hu hakudya nk'hande miye naila du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">masozi yangu yaseela enga mazi ya mto.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Kiya hogoha nicho nikipatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">diya nandaga hogoha dinipata<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Hina utondowazi hegu kuhumula;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">hikudaha kuhumula naho makunt'ho yangu hayana uheelo.<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi akonga kulonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Niho Elifazi yudya alaile Temani amuuzaga Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />Togola miye nnaunga kulonga na weye noukeive vihile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Kwaviya hikudaha kukekindila nisekulonga.<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Tegeleza, weye kuwahiniza wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">naho wawaambizaga want'hu wasokele wande na ludole.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Ulosi wako wawenulaga wadya wafaga chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">naho wawatogezaga wadya wandaga haweina ludole.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Mna haluse makunt'ho aya yakwizila weye nawe kufa chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">naho kwingila wogohi.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Togola kumvika Mnungu kwako hidyo kawiilo dyako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">naho udamanyi wako wedi nuwo mwigamo wako?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Hake fanyanya. Ni muwagilwa yuhi akudugana na mp'halanyuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Ni kuhi uone wata uwedi wabanangwa pele?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Ivo miye nimanyize na kupelemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">wakuhanda yaihile nawavune yaihile.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Mnungu awakoma kwa muye wakwe, kwa sindo ya maya yakwe wabanika.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Waihi wabuma enga simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">mna meno yawe yatulwa.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Simba yabanika kwa kuswesa ludyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">na awo wana simba wapangana.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Ulosi wanizilaga kwa kinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">name nayevaga yadya yatakamizwe.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Handa mwe kufanyanya zisozi za nekilo zikugela kiyangayanga, umwo nt'hongo zizamile zikuwapata want'hu.<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Nogohesaga niyo nazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">na mwili wangu wose niyo wengila lukeng'ent'ha.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Mp'heho yombokaga he futa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">fili nazo zo umwili wangu zakimalaga.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Mp'heho iyo yakimalaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">mna nisekumanya yandaga ni kint'hu chani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">naonaga enga kint'hu chandaga ha meso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">kwandaga kunyamalikizana niyo neva izwi dikalonga.<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />“Togola mnt'hu adaha kunda mhuwilwa kujink'ha Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Togola mnt'hu adaha kunda ywedi kujink'ha Muumbi ywakwe?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Uneva Mnungu hakuwahuwila wandima wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">na watumigwa wakwe wa kwe mbingu awaona wana masa,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />togola havitendese awo want'hu waumbigwe kulawa mwo ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">awo wakudaha kutigint'hwa enga sondo?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Kwa lupisi luguhi du want'hu wadaha kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">kubanangwa ulo na ulo haheina kuleka hata kilagiso.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Woho ni enga hema dikudaha kugwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">Ivo wabanika haheina kunda na mzungu.”<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Haluse itanga uwone uneva kuna akuunga akuhitule.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Ni yuhi mwa awo mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu akuunga akuhitule?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Kuika usungu mwo moyo kwamkoma mnt'hu mhezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">naho finju yamkoma mnt'hu mbwalasi.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Namuonaga mbwalasi akekala vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">mna nailigitaga kaya yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Wana wakwe hawana wamizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">nawo hahana mnt'hu ywa kuwagombela.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Wata sala nawo wadya ulozo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">naho kuyaguha hata yemgati mwe miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">wata kumunk'hwa nawo waumelamela vitendese ugoli wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Kwaviya yaihile hayakulawa mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">naho makunt'ho hayakulaila mwo ulongo.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Mna mnt'hu elekwa apate makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">enga sese za moto mwo ulanga.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Uneva ni miye hegu nehimhitukila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">na kumwigaila masulumizo yangu kwake.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Yehe adamanya mbuli nk'hulu hezikumanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">mbuli zo kwehela hezikuwazika.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Yehe alava fula inye mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">na mazi ya kuseela mwe zink'honde.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Awakimalisa wadya wakukeseleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">na wadya wakuhongeza awenk'ha utondowazi.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Aibananga mizungu ya wadant'hi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">vileke udamanyi wawe usekukint'ha.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Yehe awagwila wata upapala mwe zinyambi zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">naho asunguza kuibananga mizungu yawe.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Mwo lupisi lwa nomsi woho waona ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">naho kisingi hawakuona enga nekilo.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Mna Mnungu awayokola wakiwa wasekukomwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">awausa heweena kint'hu kulawa mwe mikono ya wata ludole.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Ivo wakiwa wana kawiilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">nawo wakuhujilwa wahauswa.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />Kavikilwa mnt'hu yudya akukanywa ni Zumbe Mnungu adamanye ayedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">ivo usekumbela Mnungu mta ludole umwo akatenda ivo.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Kwaviya yehe alumiza naho alagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">yehe alumiza, naho kwa mikono yakwe ahonya.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Hata uneva masulumizo nayakulaile nk'hanana mtandatu nayakuyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">naho nk'hanana mfungate houpate uwihi wowose.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Naawayokole ne file mwo lupisi lwa gumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">mwe nk'hondo nk'hulu naakuyokole.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Nowamilwe ne zimbuli ziihile za want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">naho howogohe ubanangi uwo ukwiza.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Mwo lupisi lwa gumbo na makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">naho howogohe makala mbago.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Kwaviya howogohe kulima nk'honde zina maiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">naho makala mbago hayakukump'hukile.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Nouwikale kwa utondowazi mwe nyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">nouwaze ugoli wako naho hokunde na chochose chagile.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Nounde na wana wengi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">nawande wengi enga mani ya mwe isi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Noubanike ukanda ne miyaka mingi mwo udala wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">enga masukiza ye ngano ivo yakugendeela kukula kubula mwo lupisi lwa kuvunwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Kidipelemba idi naho kibunk'hula kugamba ni dya kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">ivo ditegeleze na kudidamanyila ndima.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kamhitula Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula Elifazi,<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />Uneva usungu wangu unadaha kuhimwa, naho masulumizo yangu yanaikwa mwe kihimo,<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />nayande yazama kujink'ha msanga wa mp'hwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">nivo vikuleka hilonga haheina kufanyanya.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Zumbe Mnungu kanilasa kwa misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">naho usungu we misale yenela mwo mwili wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">Mnungu kanigaila makunt'ho makulu yakunitenda nogohe.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Togola mp'hunda ya kwe mbago yaila ikanda na mani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">hegu ng'ombe ikaila ikanda na nk'hande?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Togola want'hu nawaone vedi umwo wakadya nk'hande heeina munyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">hegu ulemu we ditagi kwadaha kunda no umwiile?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Moyo wangu walemela hata kutoza nk'hande izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">izo ni nk'hande zikuniihiza.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Yandile Mnungu anink'hile kiya hulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">nevinda vedi anink'he kiya huunga.<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />Ivo Mnungu aungile kunihonda, hegu nakunikoma yehe mwenye!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Hegu atendile ivo miye nehinda no utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">kwaviya hipata makunt'ho yatendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">hamwenga na kugamba nk'hanana zose hiizumila milosi ya akukile.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Mna hina ludole lwa kufinyiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">Hina kikunitenda nigendeele kunda mgima.<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Togola miye nna ludole enga iwe? Hegu mwili wangu ni enga shaba?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Togola nnanao udahi wowose wakunambiza miye mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">kila mwigamo uhauswa kwangu.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />Mnt'hu ananda mwe makunt'ho aunga wambwuya wakumwambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">hata uneva himleka Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Mna wambwiya zangu wanidant'hilizaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">enga vizuto va lulpisi lugihi du,<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />vigubikwe ni balafu vikulungumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">na balafu ikefisile mndani mwawo.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Mna mwo lupisi lwa kubwikana mabalafu yalungumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">naho mwe kiangazi vasigala vizuto heviina mazi.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Misafa ya wachuuzi yaga sila wakazungula mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">wakwela mwe nyika na wabanikila uuko.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Misafa ya wachuuzi wa Sheba na Watema wazungula mazi,<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />mna wahuzaga mnk'handa mwe vizuto ivo kwaviya kawiilo dyawe dyagaga,<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Nyuwe ni enga vizuto ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">mwaonaga masulumizo yangu niyo mwauya kunyuma kwa wogofi.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Togola hiwalombezani kint'hu chochose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">hegu higambani mlave matundu kwa mnt'hu vileke miye nihone,<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />hegu mniyokole kulawa mwa wank'hondo na want'hu heweena mbazi?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Vedi, nihinizeni name neninyamale zii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">nigambileni aho nibanange.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Milosi ya kindedi ina ludole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">Mna kuhigana kwenyu hakuna kint'hu?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Togoleni mwafanyanya kugamba mwadaha kuyapelemba yadya nilongile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">Kwaviya hina kawiilo, mwafanyanya kugamba milosi yangu hi kint'hu?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Mwadaha hata kutoa simbi awo wana nk'hiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">na kuwataga wambwiya zenyu vileke mnde wagoli!<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Mna haluse mwaungigwa mnikaule na miye heniwadant'hilizeni.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Fanyanyeni naho msekunisengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">kwaviya miye ni mnt'hu ywedi.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Togoleni mwafanyanya kugamba nadant'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">bule kwaviya namanya yaihile na ayedi.<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Mnt'hu ana ndima ndala mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">aungingwa kudamanya ndima kila zuwa enga mndima,<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Yehe ni enga mtumwa akuunga kizuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">naho enga mndima akugojela kulihwa.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Mna kwangu hina chochose cha kukawiikla mwe miezi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">name nna masulumizo kila nekilo.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Umwo hagona nagamba, nokuche ini?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 7:4">Kilo chose nhitukahituka mwo lusazi hikupata nt'hongo mpaka kwacha.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Mwili wangu umema nt'hende na usavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">nk'handa yangu inyala na kutumbuka naho yalawa ufila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">ufila wamint'huka mwe zink'hwenge zangu.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Mazuwa yangu yasunguza komboka enga kint'hu cha kufumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">nazo zabula uheelo wakwe haheina kukawiila.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu kumbukila wikazi wangu ni enga muye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">na kinyemi changu kisila.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Akuniona haluse hanione naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">nounizungule mna hihali.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Enga vunde ivo dikuhauka niyo dyaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">nivo weli want'hu wakubanika naho hawakuuya.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Haauye naho ekale mwe nyumba yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">na want'hu wammanyize nawamjale.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Kwaivo hikunyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">nelonge kulagisa masulumizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">nenilabile kulawa mwo usungu wo moyo wangu.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Togola, miye ni bahali hegu kala kulu dikwikala mwe mazi matali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">hata uniike mwo wamizi?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />hagamba nnagona mwo lusazi nenihumule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">na masulumizo yangu nayahunguke.<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />Wanitisaga kwa sozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">naho kunitenda nogohe kwa maona.<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />Ni vedi kukenyogotola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">na kubanika kujink'ha masulumizo aya.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Hingila chevu, naho hisokela kunda mgima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">Nilekeni kwaviya wikazi wangu hi kint'hu.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Want'hu ni kint'hu chani hata umkaule?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">niyo wamfanyanya mwo moyo wako?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Weye weza kuwakaula kila mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">na kuwageza kila lupisi.<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Togola nougendeele kunikaula mpaka ini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">haheina kunilekela hata kwa lupisi ludodo du?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Uneva hidamanya wavu hutendelei weye mwamizi wa want'hu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Nii ninde nyambilo kwajili ya yadya ukuunga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Togola miye hinda nt'hwika kwako?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Kwajili yani kulemela kunilekela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">na kuniusila wavu wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Kwaviya lupisi luguhi neniite kwe kikuta changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">weye nawe nounizungule mna honione naho.<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Niyo Bilidadi uyo Mshuhi amhitula Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />Togola kubinda kulonga mbuli zako heziina kint'hu?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Togola wagamba Mnungu hakudamanya uwagilwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Hegu azaganya ikindedi?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Wanao nawande wamtendela Mnungu wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">yehe kawenk'ha usengelo kwa wavu wawe.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Uneva unaleka zifanyanyi zako na kumlombeza Mnungu kwa kukombeka,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />na kwikala wikazi wa uwedi na uhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">kindedi Mnungu neeze kukwambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">nakukuvuzila uwagilwa mwo wikaqzi wako.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Ugoli uwazile nounde hiyo kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">ukaliganyiza na kiya Mnungu naakwink'he.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Ukauze vyeleko vilongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">naho uone ayo wabunk'hule wakale wawe.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Ivo suwe chelekwa ivinoivino naho hakimanyize dyodyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">mazuwa yetu ya mwe isi yomboka enga kizuli.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Mna want'hu wakilongoelaga kwelekwa nawakuhinize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">naho utegeleze kiya wakuunga walonge<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />“Togola ndulutu zahotela hant'hu haheina mazimazi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">hegu ngage yahotela haheina mazi!<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Umwo zikagendeela kukula zikanda zikei kukant'higwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">zinaswesa mazi zasunguza kunyala kujink'ha mani matuhu.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Nivo wili uheelo wa awo wose wakumjala Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">Kawiilo dya wadya hewekumhuwila Mnungu nedyage,<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />na kawiilo dyawe ni enga bwilili.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Dyaketozela mwo luzi lwakwe mna halukimala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">Togola waneketozeleza umwo nawatoge?”<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Want'hu waihile ni enga lukoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">kukanda na fula na zuwa yekala vedi mwe kiunga.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Maizi yakwe yakezinganiza mwe maiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">na kuketozela mwe kila luwe.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Mna yanango'lwa kulawa hant'hu hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">hahali naamanye kugamba yandaga aaho.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Kaula, uwo nuwo uheelo wa kinyemi cha want'hu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">na hant'hu hawe nawaguhe watuhu.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Mna Mnungu hamduule mnt'hu muwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">hegu hawaambize waihi.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Yehe naakutende useke naho kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Mna yehe naawagele soni wadya wakukuihiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">naho kaya za waihi nezihauswe.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu niyo amhitula Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula.<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />Kindedi namanya ivo nivo vili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">Mna mnt'hu adaha vivihi kunda ywedi ha Mnungu?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Uneva mnt'hu aunga kuhigana naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">haadahe kumhitula Mnungu hata nk'hanana imwenga mwe mbuli alufu imwenga.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Yehe ni mta mzungu vitendese naho ana udahi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">niani akuhigana naye na kumhuma?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Yehe ahausa milima uku yenye hekumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">na kwa maya yakwe aibananga.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Yehe aisingisa isi kulawa hant'hu hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">na kuitenda mikola yakwe izingize.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Alagiza dizuwa disekunt'hont'homoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">azigubika nt'hondo zisekulava ung'azi.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Yehe ekedu niye aikile mbingu hant'hu hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">na kujata mjubwaniso we bahali.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Yehe niye aziikile nt'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">za Dubu na Olioni na Kilimilwa na fyo dya nt'hondo za kusini.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Adamanya mbuli nk'hulu hezikuhimika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">mbuli zo kwehela hezikuwazika.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Kaula, Zumbe Mnungu omboka hagihi na miye mna hikumuona, niyo akeitila haheina miye kumanya.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Umwo akaguha kiya akuunga, “Niani akudaha kumkindila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Niani akudaha kumuuza wadamanyai?”<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Mnungu haakindile maya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">hata uneva ni fyo dya mazimwi makulu ya mwe bahali nedifunamize mitwi yawe hasi kwa wogohi.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Togola miye nenizilavehi mbuli za kumhitula Mnungu?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Hata uneva nandaga muwagilwa mna nadundugaga kumhitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">yehe niye wa kunisengela, icho hulombeza anionele mbazi.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Hata uneva namwitange naye niyo anihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">hehadaha kuhuwila kugamba anitegeleza.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Yehe nakanibananga kwa nk'hung'unt'ho nk'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">na kongezekela zink'wenge zangu haheina kint'hu.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Hakunileka nihumule hata hadodo, q wikazi wangu kaumemeza usungu.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Uneva ni kuhigana, yehe ni mta ludole!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Uneva ni mbuli ya uwagilwa niani akudaha kumwigala kwe kitala?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Hata nandile hina masa ulosi wangu nounisengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">ikanda hina masa yehe nakanilagisa masa yangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Hata uneva miye hina masa hi kint'hu kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">miye nauwihiya wikazi wangu,<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Yose ni yamwenga du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">Mnungu awasengela awedi na waihi.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Mp'halanyuka umwo zikalaila want'hu wabanika kimp'humpa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">na Mnungu asekela mavumo ya want'hu wakufa cheevu haweina masa.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Yehe kalekela isi ikailwe ni want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">yehe kayagubika meso ya walamuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">uneva hiyo yehe elo ni ani?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />Mazuwa yangu yagulukisa kujink'ha yudya akuguluka, zasunguza komboka haheina kuona mbuli zedi.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Mazuwa yangu yomboka enga ngalawa ikugulukisa mwe mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">enga ngwilizi dikukump'hukila ukala wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Uneva nnalonga neniyajale yadya hulabila, nenihause kinyulu na kunda na kinyemi.<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />Mna nogoha masulumizo yangu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">kwaviya namanya kugamba Mnungu hanione kugamba hina masa.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Uneva nnaoneka ni mta masa, nii nisulumile haheina kint'hu?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Hata uneva nnakesunt'ha na sabuni na kuisunt'ha mikono yangu kwa mazi yedi.<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />Hata ivo nounidule mwe dibome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">hata suke zangu mwenye zaniihiya.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Mnungu andile mnt'hu hegu nehidaha kumhitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">hegu nekiitanya mwe kitala vileke kikalamulwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Hahana hata yumwenga wa kulamula mgati mwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">uyo akudaha kulamula mwa suwe waidi.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Weye Mnungu usekugendela kunisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">uniike hale na vitiso vako.<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Hegu nehadaha kulonga naye haheina kumwogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">mna kwaviya nakemanya ivo nili mwo moyo wangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Nauwiihiya vitendese ugima wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">nenigendele kulabila ivo nilumile vitendese naho nilonge kwa usungu.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Nenimgambile Mnungu, usekunisengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">mna unigambile hibanangai?<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Togola ni vedi kwako unihujile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">kuniilemela miye uniumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">uku ukanda na kinyemi mwe mizungu ya waihile?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Togola wakaula vint'hu enga ivo wakuona want'hu? Hegu waona enga ivo wakuona want'hu?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Togola wikazi wako mguhi enga udya wa want'hu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">hegu miyaka yako ni enga ya mnt'hu<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />hata upelembe uwihi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">na kuuzungula wavu wangu?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Weye wamanya kugamba miye hina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">naho hahana wa kuniyokola mwe mikono yako.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />Mikono yako niyo iniumbile na kunitenda ivi nili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">mna haluse wanibananga.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Kumbukila kugamba waniumbaga kwa ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">togola nounivuze naho mwe sanga?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Weye ni weye umwink'hile ludole tate lwa kunipata miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">ni weye utendile nikule mwe ndaa ya manala?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Waumbaga mwili wangu kwa mavuha ne misipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">na kunilunganya kwa nyama na nk'handa.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Wanink'haga ugima na kunitendela uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">mwo ulangilizi wako waamila muye wangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Hata ivo mbuli izi wazifisaga mwe kinyele chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">na miye namanya kugamba ayo yandaga mwo ubala wako.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Wandaga ukagojela uone uneva hidamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">vileke ulemele kunihausila uwihi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Hangi miye mwenye uneva nna masa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Uneva miye ni mhuwila hikudaha kukeduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">kwaviya miye himema uhuza nnayakaula masulumizo yangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Uneva nnaketenda hitoga, nouninyatile enga simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">na kunilagisa udahi wa kutisa mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Weye waleta waona wahya wanihige miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">na kongezela maya yako mwa miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">wanigaila wank'hondo wahya wanitowe.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />Kwaajili yani wanilekaga nelekwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Neinda vedi kubanika umwo want'hu hawanati kuniona.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Nehigalwa mpaka kwe kikuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">neinda vedi nandile hihali.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Togola mazuwa ya wikazi wangu hiyo mageke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">Nilekele vileke nidahe kupata lupisi lugeke lwa kunda ne kinyemi.<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />Umwo hinati kuita hant'hu uko heniuye naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">mwe isi ina kinyulu na ziza dititihale.<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />isi ina ziza enga kilo gati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">isi iyo ung'azi wakwe ni enga ziza.<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">Sofali amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Niho Sofali mbwiya ywa Ayubu alaile Naamati amhitulaga Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />Togola kulonga milosi mingi yakutenda unde no uwagilwa?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Togola nigendeele kunyamala umwo ukalonga mbuli zako ze kihezi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">Hegu kisekukufank'hila umwo ukambela Mnungu?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Wamgambila Mnungu kugamba mahinizo yangu ni ya kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">name ni ywedi hameso hako.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Naungisa Mnungu akuhitule!<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />Na yehe akugubuile kinyele cho mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">kwaviya umanyi we kindedi hiyo mhufu kuumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">mna umanye kugamba Mnungu hakuwaza masa yako yose.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />Togola wadaha kumanya kinyele cha Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">Hegu wadaha kupelemba mbuli za Mnungu?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Ukulu wakwe Mnungu u kulanga kujink'ha mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">naho hukudaha kudamanya chochose mwa idyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">Uzangalamu wakwe wajink'ha mnyongomela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">mna weye hukumanya?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Ukulu wa Mnungu ni mkulu kujink'ha isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">uzangalamu wakwe wajink'ha bahali.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Mnungu adaha kukugwila na kukugela mwe magezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">niani akudaha kumkindila?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Mnungu kawamanya want'hu heweena uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">naho aona udamanyi wawe wihile.<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Mhezi hakudaha kunda na umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">hegu viya mp'hunda heikudaha kweleka mnt'hu.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Ayubu keiile kwa Mnungu ukazungula wambizi wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Uneva kuna wavu mwe nyumba yako uleke.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Aho, nouwakaule want'hu haheina soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">noukimale haheina kogoha.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Noujale makunt'ho yako yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">neinde enga lawo dyomboke, houkumbukile naho.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Wikazi wako naung'ale kujink'ha zuwa dya nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">ziza dyakwe nedihituke kunda ungazi wa mtondo tondo.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Nounde hant'hu hatondowale kwaviya una kawiilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">Mnungu naakwamile na kukuhumuza.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Naugone haheina kutiswa ni mnt'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">want'hu wengi naweze kukulombeza wambizi.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Mna meso ya waihi hayaone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">sila zawe zose za kunyilikila nezage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">kawiilo dyawe dyo uheelo ni kubanika.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu ahitula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />Nyuwe want'hu mwakeona kugamba mwamanya kila kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">naho mwafanyanya kugamba umwo mnabanika hokunde na umanyi naho.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Miye namanya enga ivo mkumanya nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">miye name ni mbala kujink'ha nyuwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Kila mnt'hu ayamanya ayo mkulonga?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Hata wambuya zangu waniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">waniseka ikanda miye nna uwagilwa na hiina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">hinda seko kwa want'hu.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Nyuwe hamna makunt'ho, mna mkei mwanibeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">nyuwe mwamtoa mnt'hu abunt'hike,<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Wahoki na want'hu hewemmanyize Mnungu wakeona enga wekala kwa utondowazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">hamwenga na kugamba wegamila ludole lwawe enga mnungu nywawe.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Hata madege na mifugwa wananayo yabindile wingi yakuwahinizani.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Hegu uzeni viumbwa va mwe isi na mwe bahali umanyi wawe.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Wose wamanya kugamba udahi wa Zumbe Mnungu nuwo uwatendile.<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Mnungu niye akulongoza wikazi we viumbwa vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">na ugima wa kila kint'hu umwe mikono yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Ni enga viya lulimi lwako ukubweda mwile we nk'hande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">na magutwi yako yelelwa kwa kwiva milosi?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Wadala wana mizungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">na kwa wadya wekale kwa lupisi lutali.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Mna umanyi na udahi ni va Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">yehe ana umanyi na ubala.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Anamola hahana akudaha kuzenga naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">anamvugaila mnt'hu hahana akudaha kumkomoela.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Uneva Mnungu anakindila fula chapata nk'hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">anayakomoela amazi chapata lawo.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Yehe ana ludole na mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">wose wakudant'hilizwa na akudant'hiliza we mwe mikono yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Yehe ahausa mzungu wa vilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">na kuwatenda vilongozi wadamanye enga wabwalasi.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Yehe ahausa udahi wa maseuta na kuwatenda enga wavugailwa.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Yehe awatenda walavant'hambiko na wata ludole waone soni.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Yehe awatenda walangilizi wakuhuwilwa wanyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">na kuhausa mzungu wa wadala.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Awagela soni wata udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">na kubananga udahi wa vilongozi.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Awalagisa want'hu mbuli za kinyele, naho yehe alangaza hant'hu hana ziza.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Azitenda isi zinde nk'hulu na zitogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">Naho azihuma na kuzibananga.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Awatenda vilongozi we isi wande wabwalasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">na kuwaleka wangadike wakanda wazaganywa na uheelo wawe ni kwaga.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Wababasa babasa mwe diziza na kuzembeduka enga wakozi.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Aya yose hiyaona kwa meso yangu, na kuyeva kwa magutwi yangu mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Miye namanya enga ivo mkumanya nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">miye hiyo mnt'hu msokezi kujink'ha nyuwe.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Mna nehaunga nilonge na Mnungu mta udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">nehaunga kumlagisa Mnungu kugamba nna uwagilwa<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Yose yadya mlongile mwa miye ni udant'hi du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">nyuwe nyose ni enga wagangana hewena kint'hu.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Mwandile hamwalongile kint'hu, mnt'hu nakawafanyanyani kugamba mna mizungu!<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Haluse tegelezeni aya hulonga, tegelezeni ivo huwahembeleza<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Togola mwamanya kugamba nomumdamayile ndima Mnungu kwa kulonga udant'hi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">Mwafanayanya kugamba udant'hi wenyu wamwink'ha kint'hu chochose Mnungu?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Togola nomgeze kumuungisa Mnungu kujink'ha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Hegu mwadaha kumgombela Mnungu mwe kitala?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Uneva Mnungu ana wapelemba togola naaone dyedi kwenyu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Hegu mwadaha kumtenda Mnungu kabwalata enga ivo mkuwatenda watuhu?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Kindedi yehe naawafank'hile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">uneva mnalagisa lukunde kwa kinyele.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Na ludole lwakwe nouwagele wogofi.<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Simo zenyu haziina kint'hu ni enga maivu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">Malongelezo yenyu yasokela enga ivo wili ulongo.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Nyamaleni name nilonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">akajika lekeni kize chochose kikuunga kinipate.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Miye mwenye hikeika lumwe kwa yose nayalaile.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Mnungu anikome anaunga, hina dya kwaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">hata ivo nenizigombele sila zangu ho undiilo wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Vadahika nnadamanya ivo neinde uyokozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">kwaviya mnt'hu mwiihi hakudaha kukimaala ho undiilo wa Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Tegelezeni ulosi wangu, na yadya hulonga yevike mwe magutwi yenyu.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Haluse hikeika lumwe kwajili ya kuita kwe kitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">kwaviya miye namanya hina masa.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Niani akudaha kuhigana na miye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Uneva ni ivo neninyamale zii niyo nabanika.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Nakulombeza weye Mnungu unink'he miye mbuli mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">miye name henikefise hale na weye.<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Usekunisengela, naho usekunitenda nogohe kwa wogofi wako.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Nitange mwe kitala name nenikuhitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">hegu nilonge miye na weye uhitule.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Masa yangu na wavu wangu wi vivihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">Nilagise masa yangu na wavu wangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Nii wakefisa nisekukuona?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">niyo wanitenda miye enga mnk'hondo wako?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Togola nouditise dizani dikupuluswa ni mp'heho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">hegu kuyagulusa mabunt'hi yakupuluswa ni mp'heho?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Kwaviya kuwandika mbuli zina usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">na kunitenda ninde mkipe ywa wavu wa ubwanga wangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Kuvugaila viga vangu mwe zip'hingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">na kuzamila sila zangu zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">kwa kuika kiwalo mwe nyayo zangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Ivo mnt'hu abanika enga kint'hu kikuola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">enga suke imunguke.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Mnt'hu elekwe ni mvele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">mazuwa yakwe ni mageke ya kwikala naho yamema makunt'ho.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Abwailka enga mabwali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">anda enga kizuli kikomboka.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Togola nii wamkaulisa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">hegu noumwigale mwe kitala?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Niani akudaha kulava kint'hu chedi kulawa mwe kint'hu kisavu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Hahana akudaha.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Mazuwa ya kwikala mnt'hu yawazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">uwazilo wa miezi yakwe unanayo weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">nawe kumuikila mihaka yakwe hekudaha komboka.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Kaula hale na yehe umleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">mpaka akint'hize mazuwa yakwe enga mnt'hu akudamanya ndima ya maliho.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Kwaviya diyuko kawiilo kwa mti ukant'higwe, kugamba nousukile naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">na masukiza yakwe nayagendeele.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Hata uneva maizi yakwe yadaha yaole mwo ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">naho sina dyakwe nedifile mwo ulongo,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />mna kwa kupata mazi nousukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">noulave matambi enga mti ukuhotela.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Mna mnt'hu anabanika uwo nuwo uheelo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">muye unalawa naye haoneke naho?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Enga viya mazi yakunyala mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">na mto ivo ukuleka kuseleza mazi,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />nivo akubanika mnt'hu, haanuke naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">mpaka umwo mbingu nezinde zihauka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">want'hu hawenuke hegu kwinulwa mwe zint'hongo zawe.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />Nevinda vedi hegu unifisile ko mnyongomela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">na lupisi udya uniiikile ukeza kusila na unikumbukile naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">uneva kuniikila lupisi ulwo nounikumbukile.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Togola mnt'hu anabanika adaha kwikala naho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">mna miye nenigojele mpaka makunt'ho yangu yasile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">nenigojele kudamanywa uhya.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Aho nonitange name neniitike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">hegu naho nokaunga unione miye kwaviya weye mwenye niwe uniumbile.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Niho noudahe kuwaza lugendo lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">mna houfanyanye wavu wangu.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Nounilekele malema yangu na kuyaika hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">nawe nouhause uwihi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Mna enga viya mnima ukumoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">na enga luwe ivo lukuhauswa hant'hu hakwe.<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />Enga mazi ivo yakuseela mwo mto yakuhausa maiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">na enga fula nk'hulu ikuhausa ulongo mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">nivo weye ukubananga kawiilo dya mnt'hu.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Weye wamhuma ludole nk'hanana imwenga du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">naye niyo ahauka ulo na ulo, wahitula futa yakwe na kumduila hale.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Wana wawe wakatunywa yehe hakumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">na wanabelwa yehe hakuona.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Huona usungu mwo mwili wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">na kuhongeza kwajili yakwe mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Niyo Elifazi mnt'hu wa Temani amhitula Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />togola, mnt'hu mta mzungu ahitula kwa ulosi wa ubwalasi?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Mnt'hu mta mzungu hakudaha kulonga enga ivo ukulonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">hegu kukegombela kwa mbuli heziina kint'hu?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Weye walagisa kubela kumvika Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">na kuwakindila watuhu wasekumhuwila.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Wavu wako nuwo ukukutenda ulonge ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">nawe kusagula kulonga enga wadant'hi.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Ulosi wako mwenye wakusengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">yadya ulongile yalava uwona mwako.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />Togola weye ni mnt'hu ywa nk'hongo kwelekwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">Hegu weye wandaga aaho umwo Mnungu akaidamanya milima?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Togola weye kuimanya mizungu ye kinyele cha Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">Hegu weye mwenye ukedu ni mta mzungu?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Togola weye wamanya mbuli yani iyo suwe hekiimanyize?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Kikehiniza mizungu kulawa kwa wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">welekwe aho isi yandaga ikei kuumbigwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Togola kusangalaza akukwink'ha Mnungu ni kudodo kwako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">Hegu milosi ilongigwe kwako kwa ujalamu hiyo kint'hu?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Nii umoyo wako wakutenda uihiye na kukont'hola meso yako?<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Nii kumwiihiya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">na kulonga mbuli ziihile enga izo?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Togola mnt'hu adaha kunda heena lema hameso ha Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">Hegu elekwe ni mvele adaha kunda muwagilwa hameso hakwe?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Kwaviya Mnungu hakuwahuwila wadya watumigwa wa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">na yehe amanya kugamba watendaga yaihile.<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />Kwa kindedi hamhuwile mnt'hu akuihiza naho msavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">akuungisa kudamanya uwihi enga ivo akunywa mazi.<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Haluse nitegeleze miye nenikulagise, nohugambile yadya niyaone,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />awo wata mizungu nawanihiniza ikindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">wahinaga kulawa kwa wakale wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">hawafisile kinyele chawe.<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />Awo nawo wenk'higwa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">naho hehali mta kwiza naawadant'hilize.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Mnt'hu mwavu mazuwa yose apata masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">miyaka yose waikilagwa ukwakwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Izwi dya vitiso nevimeme mwe magwitwi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">anakeona kunda ywedi, mwavu naambanange.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Mwavu hana kawiilo dya kunyilika mwe diziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">uheelo wakwe ni kubanika.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Angadikaga akazungula nk'hande, akagamba kikuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">anamanya kugamba zuwa dya ziza di hagihi.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Masulumizo na usungu vamgela wogofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">vamwizila enga seuta akeikile lumwe kwa nk'hondo.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Uwo nuwo uheelo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">awo nawo wakumhiga Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">na kukeduvya kwa Mnungu mta udahi.<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />Awo wakeduvya naho wasaguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">uku akanda na nk'hindilo nk'hulu itogile.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />wakeika lumwe kutowana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">naho wasunguza kutowana na Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Mna awo nawekale mwe mizi ya mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">na kwikala mwe zinyumba hazikwikalwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">mna nk'hondo neibanange mizi na nyumba izo.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Woho hawagendeele kunda wagoli kwa lupisi lutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">vose wananavo hevikalise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">hata vizuli vawe nevage.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Hawafose mwe diziza dye file ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">woho ni enga maziti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">matambi yawe nayokigwe nu moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">mabwali yakwe nayapuputiswe hale ni nk'hung'unt'ho.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Wasekukedant'hiliza wenye kuhuwila uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">kwaviya hawapate maliho yeyose.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Nawalihwe enga ivo viwagilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">umwo wakanda hawanati kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">na matambi yakwe hayande yekwani.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Nawaliganyizwe na mizabibu ikuhugutula zabibu mbisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">enga mzaituni ukutomosa mabwali yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Wose hewekumvika Mnungu nawande hawakweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">moto nowoke kaya za wadya wakuunga matundu ya soni.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Awa nawo wakuika mizungu ya uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">mioyo yawe nayo yalava udant'hi.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amhitula Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula, <verse eid="JOB 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />mbuli enga izo nazivaga nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">Kunisangalaza kwenyu kwanink'ha masulumizo.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Togoleni nomgendeele kulongesa mpaka ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">hegu kuna mbwai hata mgendeele kuhigana na miye?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Uneva nyuwe mwandile enga miye na miye enga nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">nehayalonga yose yadya nyuwe mkulonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">nehadaha kulava milosi yedi ya kuwasengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">nehadaha kusingisa mtwi wangu kulagisa kugamba nna mizungu.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Nehadaha kuwasangalaza kwa ulosi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">naho ulosi wangu wa kuwasangalaza nayakawenk'hani kutondowala.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Hata nnalonga masulumizo yangu hayakusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">hegu hata nnanyamala hakukuusa usungu.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Kindedi Mnungu kanisakaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">kawabananga pele want'hu wa mwe nyumba yangu wose.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Kanitenda ninyale, na want'hu wafanyanya kugamba ni mta wavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">Kunyala kwangu kwongezekela vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">na awo wafanyanya kugamba miye hidamanya wavu.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Mnungu kanitatula kwa maya na kunikaula kwa kuniihiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">naho kanda enga mnk'hondo wangu akunikaulisa<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Want'hu wanilonga kwa lubezo na kuniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">wadugana hamwenga nakunitowa mwe funda.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Mnungu kaniika mwo udahi wa want'hu makwank'halu, na kunileka nihumwe na want'hu waihile.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Nehinda hitondowala vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">mna Mnungu kanyakamila dilaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">kwa kunitowa na kunihonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">kanitenda kitalo che misale yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />kanilasa kwa msale kulawa kila nt'hendelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">misale yanilasa na kunigela nk'hwenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">naho kukongela aho haniolele mbazi.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Anilumiza kaidi idi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">anitowa enga mtowani aihiwe naho akuniihiya.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Hikesumila suke za magunia kulagisa kugamba nahongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">hitoigwa na kwikala mwo luvumbi.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Futa yangu inda ink'hundu kwa kuila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">makumbitu yangu yanda matitu tii.<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />Hata ivo mikono yangu haidamanye uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">na malombezo yangu ni yedi kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Weye isi, usekuigubika sakame yangu itike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">ndilo yangu neyenele kila hant'hu.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Hata ivi haluse muwona wangu e kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">mta kunigombela e kulanga.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Wambuya zangu wanibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">meso yangu yalawa masozi kwa kumlombeza Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Naunga mnt'hu wa kunigombela ha Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">enga ivo mnt'hu akudaha kumgombela mbwiyaye.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Miyaka yangu isigale ni migeke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">name nenibanike heniuye naho.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Hisokelesa naho ni hagihi kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">hakihali kisagale mna ni kikuta.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Kindedi wadya wakunibela wanizunguluka, lubezo lwawe naluona pwilili.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Weye Mnungu unambize ninde mlekelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">kwaviya hahana mtuhu wa kunigombela.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Umanyi wawe kuugubika wase kuukombaganya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">ivo elo usekuwaleka wanihume.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Mnt'hu akusezenga wambuyaze vileke ande mpati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">meso ya wana wakwe nayadunduge kuona.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Mnungu kanitenda nisekigwe ni want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">hinda mnt'hu wa kubelwa.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Hina udahi wa kuona vedi kwaviya nehihilisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">vilungo vangu vose vinda enga kizuli.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Want'hu wa Mnungu wehelwa wekayaona aya yakunilaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">naho heweena malema waihizwa na wadya hewekumuogoha Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Hata ivo wahuwilwa nawatimile sila zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">na wadya wakudamanya ayedi nawagendeele kupata ludole vitendese.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Mna nyuwe nyose uyeni naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">henimpate mnt'hu mta mzungu mwa nyuwe.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Mazuwa yangu yehagihi kusila na mizungu yangu idunduga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">kawiilo dyangu dihauka.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Wambuya zangu wakitenda kilo kunda nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">wagamba ung'azi wi hagihi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">mna miye namanya ni mwe diziza.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Kwaviya nyumba yangu ni kwe isi ya want'hu wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">nenigone umwo mwe diziza.<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />Uneva nenikitange kikuta tate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">na awo zint'hende zikunidya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">nenizitange mnala na lumbu dyangu,<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />Togola kawiilo dyangu dikuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">Niani akudaha kuona kawiilo dyangu?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Ayo ukawiila hayaite hamwenga na miye kwe isi ya want'hu wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">umwo neniseele kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi amhitula naho Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Niyo Bilidadi Mshuhi amhitula Ayubu, <verse eid="JOB 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />Togola want'hu enga weye hawakunyamala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">unde na umanyi wedi naswe niho nekidahe kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Ni suwe chafanyanywa enga mifugwa, na kuoneka wahezi haameso hako.<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Weye kukesengasenga mwenye kwa maya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">togola isi ilekigwa jangwa kwajili yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">hegu luwe luhauswe hant'hu hakwe?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />Ung'azi wa mnt'hu mwavu nouzimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">na lulija lwakwe holung'ale naho.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Ung'azi mwe dihema dyakwe unda ziza, na lumuli lukumlangazila noluzimwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Nk'hacho za mnt'hu mwihi nezinde ngihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">ulangilizi wakwe wiihile noumkinye hasi.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Viga vakwe mwenye nevimgele mwo mtego, kila akagenda naadugane na mabome,<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />tasi nedimgwile mwe kiga chakwe na kumtozeleza,<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Ditasid ifisigwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">mtego nawo umwe sila yawe.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Vikutisa vamgojela kila nt'hendelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">vamtimila kila nk'hacho naagende.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Andaga mgoli mna haluse ana sala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">mp'halanyuka zikeika lumwe kumkinya.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Unyonge wa kukoma ugenyela mwo mwili wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">naho waoleza vilungo vakwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Naauswe mwe dihema dyakwe idyo andaga akekala kwa utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">na kwigalwa kwa seuta kwa vitiso.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Want'hu watuhu nawekale mwe dihema dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">moto wa chola nowitilwe mwe nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Yehe ni enga mti unyaile maizi na matambi yakwe kulanga yanyala.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Nk'humbukila ya kwikala kwakwe neihauswe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">naho hehali naadikumbukilke dizina dyakwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Na yehe naahauswe mwe isi ya wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">kulawa mwo ungazi na kuhinga mwe diziza.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Hana wana hegu wezukulu, hahana asigale mwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Want'hu wakwikala usweelo wa zuwa wehelwa kwa yadya yampatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">want'hu awo wakwikala ulailo wa zuwa wazingizaga kwa wogofi <verse eid="JOB 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Ayo nayo nayampate mnt'hu mwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">ayo nayo nayampate mnt'hu heemmanyize Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu amhitula naho Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula, <verse eid="JOB 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />togola nii mwagendeela kunisulumiza kwa milosi yenyu?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Nk'hanana zose izi mnilonga vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">Togola hamkuona soni kunitendela vihile?<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Hata uneva kindedi hidamanya vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">togoleni ayo yawalumizani vivihi.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Togoleni mwafanyanya kugamba nyuwe ni wedi kujink'ha miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">na kutenda masulumizo yangu kunda ukindedi wa malema yangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Togoleni nyuwe hamkuona kugamba Mnungu niye anidamanyile aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">yehe kaika mtego vileke anigwile.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Uneva haila nambizeni ni mwe masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">mna hekuli akunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">hekuli akwiza kunink'ha uwagilwa wangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Mnungu kaikindila sila yangu vileke nisekomboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">kazigela ziza sila zangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Kahausa ugoli wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">na kuibanaga nt'hogola yangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Kanitowa nt'hendelo zose name hisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">kading'ola kawiilo dyangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">na kunileka ninyuluke na kubanika<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Yehe kaniihiya vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">kaniona kunda enga mnk'hondo wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Kadisigiila fyo dyakwe dya watowani na kunikump'hukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">naho wasimba mabome kuzunguluka kaya yangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />Mnungu kaitenda mp'huga yangu inileke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">miye hinda mta kwiza kwa wadya wakunimanya.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Wandugu zangu na wambwiya zangu hawakunambiza naho.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Watakwiza mwe nyumba yangu wanijala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">wandima wangu wa kivele waniona enga mtakwiza,<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Umwo hamwitanga mndima ywangu hakuniitika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">hata nnamlombeza wambizi hakunihitula.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Muye wangu wamnunk'hila mkazangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">naho wandugu zangu hawakudaha kunizila hagihi.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Hata wana wadodo wanibela na kuniseka umwo wananiona.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Wambuya zangu wakulu waihizwa na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">wadya wendile wakaniunga wanihituka.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Mwili wangu usigala mavuha na nk'handa du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">nehisigala hadodo nibanike.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Nioneleni mbazi, nioneleni mbazi nyuwe wambuya zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">kwaviya Mnungu kanitenda nisulumile ivi.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Kwaajili yani mwanisulumiza enga ivo akunisulumiza Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Togoleni, masulumizo ayo mnitendele hayakukint'ha?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />Nevinda vedi mbuli yanyu yawandikwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">naho uwandikwa mwe kitabu!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Nevinda vedi mbuli zangu zasongolwe kwa nt'hema mwe luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">hegu yawandikwe vileke yasigale mazuwa yose.<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Namanya kugamba mgombezi wangu mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">naho namanya kugamba uheelo mwa aya naakimale mwe isi anigombele.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Hamwenga na kugamba nk'handa yangu ibanangwa ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">umwo handa nikei no mwili uno nenimuone Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Miye nenimuone kwa meso yangu mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">na miye nenimmanye,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 19:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">Naho mwo moyo wangu nna nk'hwina ya kumuwona.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />“Nyuwe mwadaha kugamba nekigendeele vivihi kumsulumiza?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">Nyuwe mwazungula kint'hu cha kunisulumiza.<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />Vituhu vakwe nyuwe wenye mwaungwa kogoha usengelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">Mnungu akamuihiya mnt'hu amsengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">na kumsengela mnt'hu uyo naho nommanye kugamba ni yehe asengele want'hu.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="sp">Sofali amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Niyo, Sofali Mnaamati amhitula kugamba, <verse eid="JOB 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />Fanyanyi zangu zanitenda nihitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">kwaviya hikudaha kukekindila naho.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Naiivaga milosi yako hikudaha kufinyiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">no umanyi wangu wanigambila nihitule.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />Weye mafani kuijala mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">kugamba kukongela kale Mnungu umwo eze amuumbe mnt'hu mwe isi,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />Mwiihi naakeone mhumi kwa lupisi du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">kinyemi cha heekumvika Mnungu ni kwa lupisi luguhi du.<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Kukeduvya kwawe kubula mpaka kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">kuketogola kwakwe kukulisa,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />Mna naadulwe hale enga nt'hagata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">wadya wammanyize nawakeuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">ekuhi elo.<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Naage enga sozi, enga maona ya nekilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">na yehe haoneke naho.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Uyo amuwonaga hamuone naho, hegu hadya nakekala hahatambulwe naho.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />na wanawe nawo nawalihe yose tate yawe ayo awahokile wakiwa, na wana wakwe nawalombeze mbazi kwa wakiwa.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Akeonaga ana ludole mwo ubwanga wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">mna hiyo lupisi lutali naabanike na kuuya mwo luvumbi.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Want'hu waihi wanda na kinyemi wakadamanya mbuli ziihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">naho ni enga kint'hu kimwile mwo mnomo wakwe,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />ikanda hakudaha kuuleka uwihi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">mna waufanyanya mwo umoyo wawe.<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />hata ivo nk'hande iyo neinde isungu mwe nda yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">nekinde na usungu mkali enga wa nyoka.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Mwavu kamela ugoli wa soni naye naautahike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Mnungu naauguhe ugoli uwo.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Icho wakumela want'hu waihile ni enga usungu wa nyoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">niwakome enga mnt'hu alumigwe ni nyoka.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Yehe naye haaonele kinyemi vint'hu vedi vi mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">yehe haaonele kinyemi uki na mele vikuseeela enga vizuto.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Viya avizungule naavilekele hahena kuvidya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">ugoli aupatile haaonele kinyemi<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />kwaviya kawahujila wakiwa na kuwaleka hahena kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">kawahoka nyumba zawe wazizengile wenye.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Yehe ni mgila naho hakwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">naho haadahe kuyokola chochose akuhuwila,<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />ivo hahana chochose kisigale kwajili yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">na ugoli wakwe ubula uheelo.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Mwo wingi wo upati wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">makunt'ho nayamwizile kwa ludole.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Awo waihi waleke wadye enga ivo wakuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">Mnungu naawasengele kwa maya makulu.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Umwo wakanyilika sime ya kilama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">msale we shaba nouwapate.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Naasomole msale mwo mwili wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">na msale usongoke ungaile nousomolwe mwo mgongo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">vitiso fe file nevimpate.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Kindolo chakwe nekibanangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">Mnungu nalagize moto ubanange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">icho kisigale mwe nyumba yakwe nechokwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Mbingu neigubule uwihi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">isi neilonge uwona.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Ugoli wakwe noubanangwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">mwe maya yatendese ya Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Icho nicho Mnungu akumwink'ha mnt'hu mwavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">uheelo ukulavigwa ni Mnungu ni kwajili yawe.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu niyo amhitula Sofali</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula Sofali. <verse eid="JOB 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />Tegelezeni kwa wengele zimbuli huwagambileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">aho naho nomnde mnisangalaza miye.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Finyilizeni umwo halonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">na umwo habinda ukulonga, gendeleeni kunibela.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Togola miye namlabila mnt'hu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">Nna icho kikuleka hikudaha kunyamala.<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Nikauleni mwehelwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">nanywe nomgubike milomo yenyu kwa mikono.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Umwo hafanyanya mwa yadya yanipatile nogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">naho mwili wangu wazingiza.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Kwaajili yani waihi wagendeela kwikala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">Wakagendeela kudalahala, naho wagendeela kunda na upati.<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Wawaona wana wawe wakanda na upati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">naho wawaonela kinyemi wezukuluwe wakakula.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Mnungu hakwigala mp'halanyuka mwawe zinyumba zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">naho hahali akwikala kwa wogofi.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Majeku yawe yatongela naho hayakuhungukilwa na ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">mbuguma ne zimoli zawe zeleka naho hazikubananga nda.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Awafoseza wana wawe wadodo enga fyo, wakaseziga seziga enga fyo dya ngoto.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Wakema wila kwa mazeze na vinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">naho waonela kinyemi izwi dya miluli.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Want'hu waihi wekala miyaka ina upati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">hawakunda na makunt'ho mwo wikazi wawe hata dizuwa dya kubanikila.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Mna wamgamba Mnungu, Kileke suwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">Hakikunga kumanya sila zako.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Zumbe Mnungu nie ani hata kimdamanyile ndima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">Hata kina mlombeza naakink'hei?<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Woho wafanyanya kugamba waketenda wenye kunda wagoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">ivo nakeika hale na ulangilizi wa waihi.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />Mna ni nk'hanana nyingahi lumuli lwa waihi lwazima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Hegu nk'hanana nyingahi woho wakapata mp'halanyuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Hegu Mnungu akawakoma kwa maya yakwe,<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Mnungu hakuwapuputisa enga mani yanyaile yakupuputiswa ni mp'heho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">hegu enga luvumbi mwe nk'hung'unt'ho.<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Nyuwe mwagamba, Mnungu awasengela wana kwajili yo wavu wa watati zawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Mna miye nagamba Mnungu awasengela awo wakumtendela wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">vileke awalagise kugamba wadamanya wavu!<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Waihi wasengelwa wenye kwajili yo wiihi wawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">waungwa waone wenye maya ya Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Kwaviya aho waihi wakanda wabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">hawagendeele kufanyanya ayedi yakuwapata wana wawe?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Togola eyuko mnt'hu yoyose akudaha kumhiniza Mnungu umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">Hegu yehe niye akuwasengela hata wakwikala kwe mbingu?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Mnt'hu yumwenga abanika akanda na ludole lukint'hile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">akanda na utondowazi na kinyemi.<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />wabanika wakanda na kinyemi haheina kusulumila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">mili yawe ikanda igimbala.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Mtuhu abanika na usungu mkulu wa moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">akanda akei kupata mbuli yoyose yedi.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Hata ivo wose wabanika na kumoselwa msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">wose wagubikwa kwa nt'hende.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Tegelezeni, miye namanya fanyanyi zenyu zose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">na mizungu yenyu ya kunibela.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Mwagamba, “Ikuhi haluse nyumba ya uyo mnt'hu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">nyumba ekale mnt'hu mwiihi ikuhi?”<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Togola hamuwauzele womboka sila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">Togola hamtegeleze vint'hu wakulonga?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Mnt'hu mwavu ahauswa mwe dizuwa dya mp'hlanyuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">Naho kugamba mwihi ayokolwa mwe dizuwa dya maya ya Mnungu?<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Hehali wakuwalongeleza waihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">Hegu wakumliha kwa yadya adamanye.<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Umwo anaguhigwa kwigalwa mwe kikuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">kikuta chakwe nekinde na waamizi<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Want'hu wengi wakelunga mwo ludongo lwa kuita kwo kummosela msanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">naho umwo akamoselwa msanga ulongo wauseleza mp'halahole.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Ivo nyuwe mwadaha vivihi kunisangalaza kwa uwo uhezi wenyu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">kila icho mkunigambila ni udant'hi du!<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi alonga nk'hanana ya katatu</para>
  <para style="sp">Uhituzi wa Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Niyo Elifazi ahitula. <verse eid="JOB 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />Togola mnt'hu adaha kumwambiza Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Hata mta mzungu hakudaha kumwambiza Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Togola kunda muwagilwa kwamwink'hai Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">Hegu unanda ywedi kwamwambiza kwa chochose?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Hiyo kwaviya wamhuwila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">nivo vikuleka akukanya na kukwigaila magezo.<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Bule, ni kwaviya wavu wako ukulisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">Naho ni kwajili yo uwihi wako wose howiina uheelo.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Weye wamtendaga nduguyo akuvuzile matundu ayo awazimaga kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">naho waguhaga suke imwenga iyo andaga nayo niyo wamwasa kimbwigili.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Humwink'hile mazi yo kunywa uyo asokele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">nawe humwink'hile nk'hande uyo mta sala.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Kwaviya kumleka mnt'hu mdahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">aguhe isi yako,<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Hiyo du kugamba nokulemela kuwambiza wadya wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">naho iviya iviya nokuwabaila na kuwahujila wana nk'hiwa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Nivo vikuleka mitego yakuzunguluka nt'hendelo zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">na wogohi wakwizila.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Nivo vikuleka ziza dikugubika usekuona kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">na malawo ya mazi yakugubika.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Togola Mnungu hehali mwe mbingu za kulanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Na yehe azikaula zint'hondo kwa hasi hata uneva zikulanga vitendese!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Mna weye wagamba, “Mnungu amanyai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Yehe kakefisa mwe mavunde adaha vivihi kukisengela?”<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Weye wafanyanya kugamba mavunde yazamile yamsikiza asekuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">aho akagenda mwo ulanga we isi.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Togola nouitimile sila ya kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">iyo want'hu waihi waitimilaga?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Wabanikaga wakanda lupisi lwawe halunati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">na malawo nayawakubila pele.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Awo nawo wamlemele Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">na kuhuwila kugamba yehe hakudaha kuwatenda dyodyose.<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Mna Mnungu niye amemeze nyumba zawe vint'hu vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">ivo nakakeika hale na ulangilizi wa waihi.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Wata uwagilwa wakaona kugamba waihi wasengelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">awo wanda na kinyemi na kuwaseka.<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />Wagamba, kindedi wank'hondo wetu wakomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">moto wokaga ugoli wawe usigale.<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />Haluse, Ayubu mmanyise Mnungu vileke unde na utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">aho naho mbuli zedi nezikwizile<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Uhokele mahinizo kulawa kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">naho uwiike mbuli zakwe mwo umoyo wako.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Uneva unamuuiya Zumbe Mnungu na kukeseleza nouvuzwe uhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">na kuuhausa uwihi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">udamanyike mwe nyumba yako,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />viduule vint'hu vako va zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">zahabu ya Ofili uwiduule kwo mto.<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />Zumbe Mnungu mta ludole naande zahabu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">naye naande masawa yako ya yombe kulu.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Aho niho nounde na kinyemi kwa Mnungu mta ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">na kubunk'hula kugamba, yehe niye chotoko che kinyemi chako.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Umwo ukalombeza naye naakuhitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">nawe noudamanye yadya umlagane Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Kila kiya ukuunga udamanye nekidamanyike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">ung'azi nawo noumulike sila zako.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Kwaviya Mnungu awaseleza wadya wakukeduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">mna awayokola wakukeseleza.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Yehe amyokola yudya heena masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">naho weye nouyokolwe kwajili yo udamanyi wako wedi.<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="sp">Ayubu amhitula naho Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Ayubu niyo ahitula.<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />Hata haluse nikei nagendeela kulabila kwa usungu, hata hikudaha kuleka kusulumila.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Hegu nevinda vedi nehamanya hant'hu aho eli Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">nehadaha kuita hata hagihi naye.<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Nehayalongeleza aya yose ho undiilo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">na kumwigaila malongelezo yangu yose ye mwe moyo wangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Nehaunga nimanye icho hegu alongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">na ivo naakaunga anihitule.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Togola Mnungu naahigane na miye kwa udahi wakwe wose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Bule, yehe hegu nakanitegeleza.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Yehe adaha kulonga na mnt'hu mhuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">Mnungu niye mlamuzi wangu hegu nakalamula kugamba, hina masa ulo na ulo.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Kaula, naita ulailo wa zuwa mna Mnungu himuone uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">nize nimzungule usweelo wa zuwa uko nako himuone.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Umwo hamzungula nt'hendelo ya kasikazini hikumuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">mna nnahituka nt'hendelo ya kusini hikumuona.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Mna yehe kaimanya kila nk'hacho hugenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">naho akabinda kunigeza, neninde ywedi enga zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Natimila lugendo lwakwe kwa uhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">sila zakwe hizitozeleza haheina kuhituka.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Mazuwa yose natimila sigilizi za Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">natimila ivo akuunga yehe, naho hiyo yadya huunga miye.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Yehe hakuhituka naho hahali akudaha kumhinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">hegu kumkindila kudamanya kiya akuunga.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Yehe naakint'hize kiya aungile kudamanya kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">na idyo ni dimwenga mwe vingi ananavo mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Ivo nazingiza kwa wogohi hameso hakwe, hata nnafanyanya du napata kizingizo.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Mnungu kautenda moyo wangu usokele, na Zumbe Mnungu kanigela wogofi<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Kwaviya higubikwa na ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">hata diziza dititihale digubika futa yangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />Kwaajili yani Zumbe Mnungu asekuika lupisi kwajili ya usengelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">hegu lupisi lwa wawagilwa kwa want'hu wakumdamanyila ndima?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Want'hu wahausa viwalo mwe mihaka mwe zink'honde zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">na watuhu nawo wabawa ng'oto na kuziika mwa mafyo yawe ya mifugwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />wawahokaga wana nk'hiwa mp'hunda zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">na kuika lahani ng'ombe ya kulima ya abanikilwe ni mgosiwe.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Wawakindilaga wakiwa wasekupata uwagilwa wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">na kuwatigiza heweina kint'hu wanyilike na kukefisa.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Ivo wakiwa ni enga mp'hunda za kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">zikuzungula nk'hande kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">hahana hant'hu hatuhu aho wakudaha kupata nk'hande ya wana wawe.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Woho wasokoza mwe nk'honde hiyo zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">nakulogota zabibu mwe zink'honde za waihi.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Nekilo wagona haheina kint'hu cha kukegubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">hawana kint'hu cha kuwasikiza ne mp'heho.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Wanyeelwa ni fula mwo mnima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">wandaga mwo luwe vileke wasekunyeelwa ne fula.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Want'hu waihi wawatenda watumwa wana heweina tati yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">wawaguha wana nk'hiwa enga maliho ya kutigizwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Wana nk'hiwa wagenda kimbwigili kwa kuswesa suke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">wavunaga ngano huku wakanda ne sala.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Wakamaga mavuta ya zeituni haheina kuluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">wakama divai mna wakasulumila kwa nk'hilu.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Na kwo mzi want'hu wehagihi na kubanika waila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">mna Mnungu hakutegeleza kulombeza kwawe.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />Weyuko watuhu waihi hawakuunga ung'azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">hawaumanyize ung'azi hegu kuita uko ung'azi.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Mkomi enuka kilokilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">na kugenda kuwakoma wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">kilo kinabula ndima yakwe ni kubawa.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Mhabwasi naye agojela ziza dingile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">naye afisa futa yakwe vileke asekuoneka.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Kilo cha ziza wabavi wavuna zinyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">mna nomsi akefisa kuunyilika ung'azi.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Woho wogoha ung'azi wa nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">mna watuhu wakogoha ziza woho waketenda ziza nidyo mbwiya ywawe.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />Mna waihi wakubilwa ni malawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">hant'hu ho ukalo wawe mwe isi haligitwa ni Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">hawakuita naho kudamanya ndima mwe zink'honde zawe za mizabibu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Enga balafu ivo ikulungumka kwa zihuye na kwa nk'hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">nivo waihi wakwaga mwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Hata wamami zawe wawajala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">want'hu waihi hawakumbukilwe naho wadigwa ne zint'hende na kubanangwa enga maziti yagwele.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Ayo yalaila kwaviya wawatendelaga vihili wavele wabanikilweni wagosi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">naho hawawatendele ayedi wavele heweina wana.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Mna Mnungu kwa udahi lwakwe awausa wata ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">hamwenga na kugamba wekala vedi mna hawana kawiilo dya ugima.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Mnungu adaha kuwaleka wakeone kugamba wekala vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">mna meso yakwe yaona sila zawe.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Waihi wapata kwa lupisi ludodo du</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">mna wanyulaka enga mani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">enga mabuwa ya mamp'hemba yasengigwe.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Togoleni, mnt'hu yeyose adaha kuyalemela aya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">Niani akudaha kulonga uwona kugamba milosi yangu hi kindedi!<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="sp">Bilidadi ahitula</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Bilidadi niyo ahitula, <verse eid="JOB 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />Mnungu ni mta udahi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">Want'hu wose waungwa wamtunye ho undiilo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">kaika useuta wakwe wa kwe mbingu mwo utondowazi.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Niani akudaha kuwaza fyo dya watowani dyamdamanyila ndima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Nihii uko ung'azi wakwe houkubula?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Mnt'hu adaha vivihi kunda mhuwila naho ywedi ho undiilo wa Mnungu?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Kwa Mnungu hata mnenge hakung'ala kujink'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">naho zint'hondo hazikungalisa hakawe.<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />Ho undiilo wa Mnungu mnt'hu hiyo kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">uyo ni enga nt'hende ho undiilo wa Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="sp">Uhituzi wa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Ayubu niyo ahitula. <verse eid="JOB 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />Msekufanyanya kugamba muambize hewena udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">naho enga ivo mumyokole heena ludole!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Togola ni ulangilizi wani wedi mnink'hile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">ikindedi hamnilagise kugamba nyuwe mna mzungu!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Togola wafanyanya kugamba niani akuunga ayategeleze ayo ukulonga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">Naho niani akulongoze ulonge ivi?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Uhituzi wa Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />Want'hu wabanike wazingiza kwa wogofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">awo wakwikala mwa mazi matali wogoha.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Isi ya wabanike haikefisile ho undiilo wa Mnungu ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">hahana ngubiko ikusikiza ho undiilo wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Mnungu niye enezaga ulanga wa kasikazini hant'hu haheina kint'hu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">na kuiika si hant'hu haheina kint'hu.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Mnungu niye ayamemeza mazi mavunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">na kuyakindila yasekutulika kwa uzami wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Yehe aufisa mnenge wose kunyuma ya mavunde.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Kaika mhaka we bahli no ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">ni hant'hu aho kilo kikusiila niyo msi wakonga.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Mikola ya kwe mbingu yazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">akazifank'hila zogoha.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Kwa mzungu wakwe aitondowazaga ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">kwa ludole lwakwe adikant'hagakant'haga zoka kulu dikwitangwa Lahabu vihande hande.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Kwa muye wakwe adamanyaga ulanga uonekele enga ivo ukuonekela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">kwa mkono wakwe adikomaga diya dizoka dikunyilika.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Mbuli ino ni ndodo du mwe udamanyi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">chayevaga kwa kutakanizwa yadya yakulongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Ni ani akudaha kumanya ukulu wa udahi wakwe?<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="sp">Ayubu amhitula Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Ayubu agendeelaga kulonga, <verse eid="JOB 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />nakelisa kwa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">Yehe hekunink'ha uwagilwa wangu na kuutenda wikazi wangu unde na usungu.<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />Umwo akagendeela kunink'ha ugima, muye wa Mnungu ukanda haunati mndani mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />Mnomo wangu houlonge udant'hi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">naho lulimi lwangu holumdant'hilize mnt'hu.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Hikudaha kugamba nyuwe mwalonga kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">mpaka kubanika kwangu nagamba hina masa.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Uwagilwa wangu nautozeleza naho hikuuleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">moyo wangu hounisengele mwo lupisi lwose hagendeela kwikala.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />Wose wakunihiga na kutowana na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">wasengelwe enga waihi na heweena uwagilwa,<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Togola mnt'hu hekumtunya Mnungu ana kawiilo dyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">umwo lupisi Mnungu akaunga kuhausa ugima wakwe?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Togola Mnungu naive ndilo yakwe, umwo anezilwa na makunt'ho?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Mwihi hakudaha kunda na kinyemi mwa Mnungu mta udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">naho heekalise mwo kumlombeza Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Hake gojeni niwahinizeni ivo Mnungu eli na udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">miye name neniwagambileni yadya akuunga ayadamanye.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Nyuwe wenye muyaona yadya adamanye Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">Haluse kwaajili yani mwalonga aya heyeena kint'hu?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Sofali amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Neniwagambile kiya Zumbe Mnungu akudamanya kwa waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">Yehe awasengela makwank'hwalu ivo wawagilwe.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Wanawe hata wande wengi nawakomigwe kwe nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">welekwa wakwe hawande na nk'hande ikukint'ha.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Awo wasigale nawabanike kwa manyonge yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">na wavele wafiilwe ni wagosi zawe hawawahongezele.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Waihi wadaha kunda na matundu mengi enga luvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">na mavalo enga kilongo,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />na yadya yose mnt'hu mwiihi akeikile kindolo, mta uwagilwa niye naayapate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">matundu yawe nayo nawakepangile want'hu haweena masa.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Nyumba akuizenga mwavu ni enga bwilili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">ni enga kaheha ka mtumwa akwamila mgunda.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Waihi wagona wakanda wagoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">mna wakenuka wanda wakiwa,<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Vitiso vamwizilaga enga malao kwa kipump'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">na nk'hung'unt'ho ya nekilo neiwapuputise.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Mp'heho ya ulailo wa zuwa nouwahagile wafose mwe zinyumba zawe,<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />mp'heho iyo yamguha haheina mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">naagendele kuwatowa umwo woho wakageza kunyilika.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Nk'hu'hunt'ho neimtimile umwo akanyilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">na umwo wakanyilika hant'hu hakwe kwa wogofi.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu autotogola mzungu wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Kindedi kuna mabome ya kusimba maiwe ya yombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">naho hana hant'hu aho ikusunt'hwa zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Want'hu wasimba kilama hasi yo ulongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">na shaba yalungumswa kulawa mwe maiwe ya shaba.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Wakusimba wamanya ivo vokulangaza ung'azi mwe diziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">woho wapelemba hasi ye isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">umwo wakazungula maiwe ya yombe.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Wasimba mabome hale na aho wakwikala want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">hegu viga va want'hu hevinati kubula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">wasimba mabome ya madini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">ukwo wadamanya ndima wakanda wenye du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">wakatozeleza sigi mwe dibome.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Vihandwa va nk'hande vakula mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">mna hasi yakwe want'hu watula maiwe kwa moto.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Mazuwe ye isi yanda na madini ya yombe nk'hulu yakwitangwa safaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">na luvimbi lwa maiwe ayo yanda na zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Hata sumula na madege matuhu yana meso ya kuonesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">hayakudaha kumanya uko weli wasimbi.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Simba na makala mbago matuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">hayanati kubula uko.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Want'hu wasimba maiwe yatogile vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">wasimba vigulu na kuvihausa hale.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Atula mabome hagati yo luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">na meso yakwe yaona maiwe ya yombe kulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Wasita zinj'hoko za mazi zisekuseela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">na kuvilava kuse hata viya vikefisile.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Mna mzungu wadaha kupatikanahi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Ni hii kikudaha kuhina mbuli kwa uwedi?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Hahana mnt'hu amanyize uwedi wo mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">naho haukupatikana mwe isi ya wata ugima.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Hant'hu ha mazi matali mwe vizuto vagamba, mzungu haumuli mndani mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">naho hant'hu ha mazi matali mwe bahali hagamba, haumuli kwangu.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Mzungu haukudaha kuguligwa kwa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">hegu kuhima kihimo kikulu cha masawa,<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Zahabu yedi na maiwe ya yombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">hayakudaha kugula mzungu.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Mzungu ni ya yombe kujnk'ha zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">hegu nyungu ya zahabu heikudaha kugula mzungu.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Mzungu una yombe kulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">yombe dyakwe hiyo enga yombe dya lulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Madini ya topazi kulawa Kushi iyo ikwitangwa Esiopia haikudaha kuligana nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">naho haikudaha kugulwa kwa zahabu yedi.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Elo haluse chotoko cho mzungu kikuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Hegu umanyi wekalahi?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Ikefisa ha meso ha viumbwa vose vina ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">naho madege ya kulanga hayakudaha kuiona.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Hata file na isi ya wabanike valonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">wakagamba kivaiva du zikalongwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Ni Mnungu ekedu akumanya sila yo mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">amanya hant'hu aho wili.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Kwaviya yehe aikaula mpaka mwo uheelo we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">naho aona kila kint'hu ki hasi ne mbingu.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Aho Mnungu aink'haga mp'heho ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">na kuika mihaka ya mazi.<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />Hegu hadya Mnungu aungaga fula inye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">na sila ikomboka mavunde ya lumwemwe na lukuwa,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />aho niho aonaga mzungu na kuhima uwedi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">na kuizumila.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Niyo Mnungu amgamba mn'thu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">“Kaula kunda na wogofi kwa miye Zumbe Mnungu nuwo mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">naho kukeika hale no uwihi nuwo umanyi.”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ayubu abindiliza utambalizi wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Niyo Ayubu akonga kulonga naho,<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />Nandile enga ivo nandaga aho kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">mwo lupisi umwo Mnungu andaga akanamila.<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />Umwo Mnungu andaga na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">andaga akanilangazila umwo hagenda mwe diziza.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Ayo nayo mazuwa nandaga mpati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">Mnungu andaga mbuyangu naye amilaga nyumba yangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />Zumbe Mnungu andaga hamwenga na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">naho wanangu wandaga hagihi na miye.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Ng'ombe ne zimbuzi zangu zalavaga mele nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">na miti yangu ya mizaituni yelekaga vedi mwo ulongo wa maiwe.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Umwo wadala wo mzi weze wabwilane kwe nk'hili yo mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">name nandanga hamwenga nawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />wabwanga weze wanione wakimalaga hank'handa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">nawo wadala wekalaga wakimalaga wanilamse.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Vilongozi wa want'hu weze wanione wanyamalaga.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Na wakulu wakumanyika walekaga kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Kila uyo anione na kwiva mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">andaga na mbuli zedi za kulonga mwa yadya nidamanye.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Kwaviya mkiwa eze aile namwambizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">na mwana nk'hiwa heena ha kuita namwambizaga.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Mnt'hu endile hagihi no kubanika anitogolaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">nakuwatenda wadya wefilwe ni wagosi zawe waone kinyemi umwo nawaambizaga.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Mazuwa yose nadamanya yadya yakuungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">naho ni enga suke zangu huvala<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Nandaga meso kwa mant'hunt'hu kwa kuwalongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">na kwa waholomp'hale nandaga mwambizi ywawe.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Kwa wakiwa nandaga tati yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">nakombekaga kuwagombela want'hu hiwamanyize.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Nabanangaga ludole lwa want'hu waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">na kuwayokola wahujilwe ni wata ludole.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Nk'hanana zose nafanyanyaga kugamba nenikale mazuwa mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">na kubanika mwe kaya yangu haheina masulumizo.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Nandaga enga mti uwo maizwi yakwe yakanda mwe mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">na matambi yakwe yajabala mnyuzu.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Kila mnt'hu anitogolaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">na ludole lwangu halunihungukile.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Umwo nalavaga ulangilizi, want'hu wanyamalaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">na kutegelezesa yadya nalongile.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Umwo nize nibinde kulonga wandaga hawana cho kongezela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">wevaga kila mbuli na kuifanyanya.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Kila yumwenga ahokelaga ulosi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">enga mnimi akukawiila fula mwo lupisi lwa vuli.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Weze wafe chevu nawalagisaga kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">na futa yangu ye kinyemi yawasangalazaga.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Naguhaga ulongozi wa kudamanya ulamuzi mwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">nawalongozaga enga seuta ivo akulongoza fyo dya watowani wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">na kuwasangalaza want'hu wafile chevu.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Mna haluse wabwanga wadodo wanibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">wabwanga awo tate zawe nawaonaga hi kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">hata kudikaula kuli dyangu dikwamila ngoto.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Awo wakunihomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">hawakudaha hata kukeambiza woho wenye,<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Wandaga wasokezi naho wanyaile kwaviya wandaga na sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">wakazungula nk'hande mwe dijangwa lupisi lwa nekilo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">na woho wapataga maizi yo kudya hant'hu hanyalise.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Wahaga mani ye miti kwe dijangwa na mani ya kwe mbago niyo wadya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">wadyaga hata maizi yo mti howiina mwile.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Wagulusagwa hale na want'hu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">watoelagwa lukunga enga wabavi.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Waungwagwa kwikala mwe vizuto vinyaile na mwe zimp'hanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">na mwe mabome yasimbigwe mnk'handa mwe chamoka.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Ukwo kwe visaka wailaga enga makala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">wakeduganyaga hamwenga hasi ye visaka.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Dyandaga ni fyo dya want'hu wahezi na wabeligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">wagulusagwa wahalawe mwe isi.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />Mna haluse wana wawe wakema mila ya kunihomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">miye hiyo kint'hu chochose, hinda ni mnt'hu ywa kubelwa ni woho.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Waniihiya na kukeika hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">wakaniona du wanitweela mate mwe kihanga.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Kwaviya Mnungu kanitenda nisokele na kubunt'hika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">ivo want'hu wanitendela chochose icho wakuunga.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Fyo idi dyagendeela kunitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">wakanigulusa na kuunga wanibindilize,<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Want'hu awo wanikindila nisekunyilika naho wageza kunibananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">naho hehali mnt'hu wa kunambiza.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Weza kwangu kulawa nt'hendelo zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">na woho wanikump'hukila umwo handa hasi vileke wanikome.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Hitozwa ni wogofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">nt'hunyo yangu ihauswa enga mp'heho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">kwa yadya yose nipatile yahauswa enga vunde.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />Haluse ni hagihi kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">hakuna lwedilwedi mwe masulumizo yangu.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Nekilo mavuha yangu yose yaluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">na masulumizo yanitoza hayakuhona.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Kwa udahi wakwe mkulu Mnungu kanda enga suke ininyinyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">Mnungu kaikwida isuke mwe singo yangu.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Yehe kaniduula mwe nt'hope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">name haluse ni enga maivu.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Weye Zumbe naila kwako mna hukunihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">nakimala kukulombeza mna hukunitegeleza.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Weye wanihitukila haheina mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">naho kunda ahile kwangu.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Wanipola na kunipuputisa kwa mp'heho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">waniduula uko na uku kwa nk'hung'unt'ho.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Himanya nounigale mpaka kwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">hant'hu aho nawadugane wose wata ugima.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Uneva mnt'hu kasokela naho ana makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">umwo mnt'hu akalombeza wambizi walemela kumwambiza.<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Togola hikuila hamwenga na wadya wendile mwa makunt'ho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">hiwaonele mbazi wakiwa?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Mna umwo nakauile ayedi, yahiile yanizilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">umwo nize nigojele ung'azi, ziza nadyo dyanizilaga.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Moyo wangu wangadika naho haukuleka mbwitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">zuwa kwa zuwa napata makunt'ho.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Unyonge wangu unitenda nk'handa yangu inde nt'hitu mna hiyo kwa kuhya na zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">hikimala mwe kiyeti cha want'hu halombeza wambizi.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Izwi dyangu ni dya kinyulu heiina wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">enga ndilo ya mauzi.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Nk'handa yangu inda nt'hitu, na miye nahuma kwa kubwikanisa.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Aho nk'hongo nevaga izwi dya zeze dya wila wa kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">mna haluse neva maizwi ya ndilo na kuhongeza.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />Hiika ndagano miye mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">yasekumkaula mndele kwa kummunk'hila.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Ni kint'hu chani Mnungu naakidamanyile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">aliha vivihi udamanyi wa mnt'hu?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />kwa wadya wakudamanya uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">Mnungu naawegaile mavuma na ubanangi?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Togola Mnungu hakuziona sila zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">na kuumanya wikazi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Nakelisa hidamanye wavu wowose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">naho higezile kumdant'hiliza mnt'hu.<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Namlombeza Mnungu anilaule masa yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">naye naamanye kugamba hina masa.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Uneva wikazi wangu hiyo wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">hegu kumunk'hilwa no uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">hegu uneva mikono yangu idamanya uwihi,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />Ivo viya nihandile wadye watuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">na yadya yose yahotile kwe nk'honde yangu yang'oligwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Uneva nehimunk'hilwa ni mvele ywa mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">hegu uneva hinyata mwo lwivi lwa mbwiyangu,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />Ivo mkazangu naamwambikile mgosi mtuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">na wagosi watuhu wagone naye.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Kwaviya mnt'hu akutenda wavu enga uwo vaugwa asengelwe kubanika.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Uneva himuungisa mvele ywa mnt'hu mtuhu, neinde kwangu enga moto wa ubanangi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">naho woke kila kint'hu nnanacho.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Uneva hilemela kuwategeleza wandima wangu we kivele na wa kigosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">yadya nawakawagilwa kuikink'higwa,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />Uneva hidamanye ivo nadaha vivihi kukimala ha Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">Naho nenilongei hadya Mnungu akeza kunisengela?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Kwaviya Mnungu uyudya aniumbile miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">niye amuumbile mndima ywangu iviya iviya.<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Miye hinati nilemele kuwaambiza wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">naho hiwalekile wadya wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawe wekale kwa kufa chevu.<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Togola hidya nk'hande nikedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">haheina kuwalekela wanank'hiwa nawo wadye chochose?<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Mna wikazi wangu wose nandaga hawalela wanank'hiwa na wavele wafiilwe ni wagosi zawe.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Hegu kuwaona want'hu wasulumila kwa kuswesa suke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">na want'hu wakiwa hewena suke.<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />Nehiwenk'ha mavalo ya mazoya yadamanywe ni ng'oto ayo yalaile mwe difyo dya ngoto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">aho niho nawanitogole kwa myoyo yawe yose.<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Uneva nezaga kuwadant'hiza wana nk'hiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">nehamanya kugamba neninde mhumi kwe kitala.<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />Ivo mikono yangu isomoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">naho ing'oligwe ifose mwe maega yangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Kwaviya nogoha kusengelwa ni Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">miye hikudaha kudamanya mbuli enga iyo.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Uneva hiika kawiilo dyangu mwe zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">hegu kuigamba zahabu weye uywedi naho ni wamizi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />Togola hipata kunda na kinyemi na ugoli wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">hegu kukefenyela uwingi wa vint'hu ivo nandaga navo.<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />Hinati kudivika dizuwa mwo ung'azi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">hegu kuuvika mnenge mwo uwedi wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />Hizaganywe kuivika milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">kwa kunonela mkono wangu kwa kulagisa wogohi kwa zuwa na mnenge.<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Kwa kudamanya ivo hegu nahaungwa kusengelwa kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">kwaviya mbuli iyo yalagisa kumlemela Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Mnk'hondo ywangu eze asulumile hione kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">hegu kukaula kwa kinyemi masulumizo umwo yeze yamwizile.<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Hinati kudamanya wavu kwa kumlombeza Mnungu awakome wank'hondo wangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Wandima wose mwe nyumba yangu wamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">kugamba nk'hanana zose nehiwahokela na kuwenk'ha nk'hande watakwiza.<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Hahana mtakwiza agonile kuse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">kwaviya nehiwasingila wakeza.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Want'hu watuhu wakombeka kufisa wavu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">mna miye hinati nifise wavu wangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Hinati nogohe kiya chendile kilongwe na want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">hinati ninyamale hegu kukevugaila kwe nyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">kwa kogoha kubelwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Uneva nokunda na mnt'hu wa kunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">hegu nehikelisa kila mbuli hulonga ni kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Mnungu anihitule.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:35" />
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Uneva malongelezo ayo yakugalwa ni mhigani wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">yendile yawandikwa vileke niyaone.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Nahavala kwa kukefenya mwe maega yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">na kukevika enga taji mwo mtwi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Nehimgambila Mnungu yose nidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">nehikimala ho undiilo wakwe, haheina kogoha enga mwana seuta.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Hinati nihande vihandwa mwe sanga hiyo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">uneva natendile ivo sanga iyo hegu neinisengela.<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />Uneva hidya nk'hande ilimigwe mwe nk'honde haheina maliho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">na kuwaleka wandima wabanike kwa sala.<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />hant'hu hakuhota ngano na shaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">yahote magugu na miwa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JOB 31:40" />
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Uheelo wa yadya alongile Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Elihu amgamba Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Ivo want'hu awa watatu, Elifazi na Bilidadi na Sofali walekaga kumhitula Ayubu, kwaviya akeonaga hana masa. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Mna Elihu mwana Balakeli we dikabila dya Buzi wa lukolo lwa Lama adundugaga kukindila maya yakwe, kwaviya Ayubu akeonaga mta uwagilwa naho amlabilaga Mnungu. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Elihu iviyaiviya awaihiyaga wambuyaze watatu wa Ayubu kwaviya nawadunduga kumhitula Ayubu na kumgamba ana masa. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Elihu andaga kanyamala zii, umwo wadala awo weze walonge na Ayubu kwaviya yehe andaga mbwanga kujink'ha woho. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Mna eze aone want'hu awo watatu wandaga hawana kint'hu cha kulonga apataga maya. <verse eid="JOB 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Ivo Elihu mwana wa Balakeli ywe dikabila dya Buzi niyo akonga kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">Miye ni mbwanga nyuwe ni wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">kwaivo nogoha kuwagambileni fanyanyi zangu.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Nakegambilaga hikuungwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">vileke nyuwe mwikale miyaka mingi mnihinize mzungu.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Mna uwo muye umndani ya mnt'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">ni muye ywa Zumbe Mnungu mta ludole nuwo ukumwink'ha mnt'hu ande no umanyi.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Hiyo wadala wekedu wata mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">hegu hiyo wata myaka mingi wakumanya uwagilwa.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Kwa ivo nagamba, nitegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">miye name neniwagambile idyo humanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Ivo miye nagojela kiya mkuunga mlonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">naho nandaga hagoja mkazungula milosi ya mizungu.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Nandaga na wengele kuwategeleza mkahamwa umwo Ayubu akalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">mna hakwandile na hata yumwenga alagise kugamba milosi ya Ayubu hayandile ya uwagilwa<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Msekulonga kugamba kina mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">Mnungu vaungwa amhitule Ayubu kwaviya nyuwe mdunduga.<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Ayubu andaga akalonga na nyuwe na hiyo miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">ivo hikumhitula enga ivo mkumhitula nyuwe.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Mbuli zako Ayubu ziwahuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">hawana mbuli yoyose ya yakukuhitula.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Togola nigendeele kugojela umwo woho wakanda wanyamala du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">woho wekale du naho hawana chochose kituhu cha kulonga?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Bule! heninyamale miye name nenilave uhituzi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">naho miye name ninilonge kiya hufanyanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Nna mbuli nyingi za kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">muye undani mwangu wanitenda nilonge.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Uneva hinapatile luneka lwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">nenitulike enga kafuko ka nk'hingo kamemile divai mph'ya.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Hikudaha kufinyiliza vaungwa nilonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">vileke nihitule.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Milosi yangu heimwink'he uwagilwa yeyose mwa nyuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">naho henikehembeleze kwa mnt'hu yeyose.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Hegu miye hidahile kumtogola mnt'hu hiyo muwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">ninatenda ivo Mnungu naasunguze kunifyalika.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />Mna haluse, Ayubu tegeleza kwa wengele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">yose huunga nilonge.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Kwaviya haluse hikeika lumwe nilonge kiya ki mwo umanyi wangu.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Miye ni mnt'hu mhuwilwa ivo wadaha kuhuwila icho hulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">nohugambile kiya humanya kugamba ni kindedi.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Muye ywa Mnungu aniumbaga na muye wakwe wanink'ha ugima.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Ika lumwe milosi yako, naho unihitule uneva wadaha,<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Miye na weye chaligana ha Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">miye na weye chaumbagwa kulawa mwo ulongo.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Kwaivo huna dya kukutenda unogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">henikuzamile kwa milosi yangu.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Haluse iki nicho nakiivaga ukalonga.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />“Weye uywedi naho hudamanye diihile dyodyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">na ni ywedi hwiina lema.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Iiviya iviya Mnungu kaunga du mwenye kunisengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">na kunitenda enga mnk'hondo ywakwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Yehe avinyinya viga vangu kwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">naho azikaula sila zangu zose kwa hagihi.”<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Mna miye nakugambila Ayubu, weye una malema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">kwaviya Mnungu ni mkulu kujink'ha want'hu.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Kwaajili yani wamlabila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">nii ugambe Mnungu hakuhitula kulabila kwa want'hu?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Hamwenga na kugamba Mnungu alonga kwa sila zi hengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">mna hehali akutimila yadya akalonga.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Mwo lupisi lwa nekilo want'hu wakagona nt'hongo zizamile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">Mnungu alonga kwa sozi na maona.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Na kuwatenda wogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">kwa makanyo yakwe Mnungu,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Mnungu alonga nawo vileke wapate kuleka udamanyi wiihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">na kuwayokola kulawa mwe kukeduvya.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Ivo awamila want'hu ne file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">vileke wanase kuita mwe kikuta.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Hegu Mnungu adaha kuwakanya want'hu kwa manyonge yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">naho adaha kuitenda imili yawe ilumise lupisi lwose.<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />Hata nk'hande hakuiyona mwiile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">naho hata nk'hande yedi yamgela kinyala.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Mwili wakwe usila kwa kunyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">naho mavuha yakwe yakefisile haluse yaoneka kuse.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Na yehe ehagihi na kuita kwe isi ya wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">file yamgojela imguhe.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Mna yumwenga mwa wandima alufu wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">vadahika mtumigwa yumwenga ywa kwe mbingu adaha kwiza kumwambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">na kumkumbusa kiya akuungwa kudamanya.<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Amwonelaga mbazi niyo amgambila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">muyokole asekwita kwe isi ya wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">kwaviya sila ya kumyokola ipatikana.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Aho mwili wakwe wadaha unde enga mbwanga naho.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Umwo akamlombeza, Mnungu naamhitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">naamvike Mnungu kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">Mnungu naamtende ekale vedi naho.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Naange ha want'hu na kugamba nehidamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">“Hidamanye uwagilwa mna Mnungu hanisengele.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Mnungu aniyokolaga nisekubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">na miye nagendeela kunda mgima.”<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Mnungu amdamanyila ivo mnt'hu nk'hanana nyingi.<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />Yehe amuyokola mnt'hu asekubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">na kumwink'ha kinyemi cho ugima.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Haluse Ayubu uneva una cho kulonga, goja nitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">niho nizumile kwa kinyemi kugamba una uwagilwa.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Uneva una cho kulonga, longa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">kwaviya naunga kukuona kugamba huna masa.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Mna uneva huna dya kulonga nitegeleze miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">nyamala zii name nenikuhinize mzungu.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Niho Elihu agendeelaga kulonga. <verse eid="JOB 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />Nyuwe want'hu mna mizungu na ubala utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">haluse nitegelezeni kiya hulonga.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Nyuwe mwamanya nk'hande yedi umwo mkaluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">mna hamkuimanya milosi ya mzungu umwo mkaitegeleza.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Ivo kisagule mbule yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">naho kilamule mwetu mbuli iyedi.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Ayubu agambaga, miye hina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">mna Mnungu kanihausila uwagilwa wangu.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Ayubu niyo agamba miye hina masa mna woho wagamba ni mdant'hi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">hilumizwa vitendese mna hina wavu.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Togoleni nyuwe mwamuonaga mnt'hu enga Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">yehe hakumtunya Mnungu vitendese?<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Yehe anda hamwenga na want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">na kunda na umbuya na wata wavu.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Kwaviya agamba, mnt'hu hakupata kint'hu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">umwo anakombeka kumwelela Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />Kwaivo tegelezeni nyuwe wata umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Mnungu hakudaha kudamanya uwihi, Mnungu mta udahi hakudaha kunda na lema.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Mnungu naamlihe mnt'hu kuligana na udamanyi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">naye naadamanye kwa kila mnt'hu kuligana na sila zakwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Ni kindedi kugamba Mnungu hakudamanya uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">Mnungu mta udahi hakuzaganya uwagilwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Niani amsigiile kuikaula isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Mnungu mwenye niye akuikaula isi yose.<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Uneva Mnungu anamtenda mnt'hu asekuhema, akahause muye wakwe wo ugima mwe isi.<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />viumbwa vose nevibanangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">na kuuya mwo luvumbi.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Uneva una ubala, haluse nitegeleze kiya hukugambiala.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Togola weye wamsengela Mnungu mta uwagilwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">Hegu weye wadaha kufanyanya kugamba Mnungu aihiwa no uwagilwa?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Mnungu awasengela maseuta na wata udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">umwo wakadamanya uhezi hegu wavu.<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Yehe hakuwaambiza zagula wakulu umwo wakabananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">hegu kuwaungisa wagoli kujink'ha wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">kwaviya wose awo ni ndima ye mikono yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Chadaha kubanika kipump'ha nekilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">Mungu adaha kukitowa na kukikoma pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">awakoma wata ludole na heweena udahi wowose.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />Mnungu aona ivo kikwikala, naho aona udamanyi wawe wose.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Want'hu wakudamanya uwihi hawakudaha kukefisa ha Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">hahana hant'hu heli ziza dititihale dya kuwafisa.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Mnungu hakumgambila mnt'hu yeyose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">kugamba niini namsengele.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Yehe awahausa vilongozi haheina kuwapelemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">na kuwaika watuhu hant'hu hawe.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Kwaviya amanya udamanyi wawe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">awahausa nekilo nawo na kuwabananga.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Yehe awasengeela waihi mwe hekieti kwajili yo uwihi wawe.<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />Kwaviya waleka kumtimila yehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">na kuzibela sigilizi zakwe zose.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Awo niyo watendile ndilo ya wakiwa ibule kwa Mnungu kailombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">ivo Mnungu evaga ndilo yawe awo wasulumizwe.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Uneva Mnungu ananyamala ni ani akudaha kumlabila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Uneva anakefisa futa yakwe niani akudaha kumuona.<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Haihali isi ikudaha kudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">vileke kumkindila mnt'hu mwihi asekulongoza.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Togola weye Ayubu kukeiila wavu wako kwa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">na kuika ndagano kugamba houdamanye naho.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Mnungu nilagise masa ayo hikudaha kuyaona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">Uneva hidamanya masa heniwiiye naho.<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Kwaviya wahiga kiya Mnungu akudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">togola wadaha kufanyanya kugamba wadaha kudamanya icho ukuunga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">ulamuzi ni wako naho hiyo wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">kigambile haluse icho ukufanyanya.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Mnt'hu yeyose mta umanyi nanizumile miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">na mnt'hu mta umanyi naanitegeleze kiya hulonga.<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />Kugamba Ayubu alonga haheina umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">mbuli izo akulonga hazina mzungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Uneva unafanyanya kila kint'hu akulonga Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">noubunk'hule kugamba alonga enga mnt'hu mwavu.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Mwo wavu wakwe kongezela kusaguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">na kulongole kwetu wagendeela kumbela Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Niho Elihu agendeelaga kulonga. <verse eid="JOB 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />Togola wamanya kugamba mbuli ino ni uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">weye wagamba hina masa ha Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />“Hegu kumuuza Mnungu ni kwa vivihi wavu wangu wakulumiza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">hegu napatai uneva hitendile wavu?”<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Miye nenikuhitule weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">na wambuyazo.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Hake kaula zimbingu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">kaula ivo mavunde yeli kulanga vitendese.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Uneva kudamanya wavu, hiyo haikumlumiza Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">Uneva unadamanya uwihi nk'hanana nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">iyo haikumgela nk'huswank'huswa.<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Iyo yamwambizai Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">hahana chochose Mnungu akupata kulawa kwako.<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Uwihi wako noumbanange mnt'hu enga weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">na uwedi wako wadaha kuwaambiza weyawo.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />Want'hu waugula kwajili ya masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">ivo walombeza wambizi kulawa kwa wata ludole.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Mna hahali akumuiiya Mnungu, Muumbi ywawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">uyo akuwenk'ha kawiilo mwe lupisi lwawe lwa ziza,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />Hawakumwiiya Mnungu uyo akitenda suwe kinde na mizungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">wata mzungu kujink'ha makala hegu madege.<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Want'hu awo walombeza wambizi mna Mnungu hakuhitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">kwaajili ye myoyo yawe midala na uwihi wawe<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Naho kuila kwawe ha Mnungu hi kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">kwaviya Mnungu haawaone hata kuwategeleza.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Togola naadahe vivihi kukutegeleza umwo ukagamba hukumuona!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">naho masa yako ye hakwe naho waungigwa umgoje,<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Weye kufanyanya kugamba Mnungu hakusengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">yehe hakukaulisa want'hu wakadamanya wavu.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Hi kint'hu kwako kugendeela kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">ni pwilili kugamba weye humanyize icho ukulonga.<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Niho Elihu agendeelaga kulonga: <verse eid="JOB 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />Nifinyilizeni hadodo naho mnitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">kwaviya nna cho kulonga kwaajili ya Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Umanyi wangu ni mkulu naho nenitende kwa kiya nimanyize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">na kulagisa kugamba Muumbi ywangu ni mhuwila.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Yose ayo nohugambile ni ya kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">miye ni hameso hako ni mta mzungu wa kindedi.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Mnungu ni mta ludole lutendese mna hakumbela mnt'hu yeyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">hakuna kint'hu heemanyize,<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Hakuwaleka waihi wagendeele kwikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">mna awenk'ha uwagilwa awo wasulumizwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Yehe awamila wata uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">kuwalekela wekale enga maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">na kutogolwa ulo na ulo.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Mna uneva want'hu wanyinywa mwe minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">wasulumila kwa kiya wadamanye.<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />Mnungu awalagisa wavu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">na kugamba woho wana kitugu.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Awatenda awo kwiva makanyo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">na kuhituka na kuuleka uwihi wawe.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Uneva wanamzumila Mnungu na kumdamanyila ndima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">nawekale mwo wikazi wawe wose kwa utondowazi naho mbuli zawe nezigende vedi.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Mna uneva hawanamzumile ivo nawabanike kwa uhezi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">naho nawabanike kwa kuswesa ubala.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Hewekumwogoha Mnungu wakanda na maya mwe mioyo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">hata umwo wakasengelwa hawalombeze wambizi.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Wabanika wakanda wakei wabwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">na uheelo wo wikazi wawe ni soni.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Mna Mnungu awahiniza want'hu kombokela masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">na kombokela makunt'ho ayafinyula meso yawe.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Mnungu akulavaga mwe makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">na kukuleka uonele kinyemi mwo kwamilwa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">na meza yako ikanda imema nk'hande.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Mna haluse wasengelwa, wasengelwa enga ivo uwagilwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Kenege vileke maya yanase kukudant'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">hegu ukulu wo ugoli wako wanase kukuzaganya,<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Togioa ugoli wako na udahi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">wadaha kukuambiza usekwingila mwe makunt'ho?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Usekuungisa kilo kize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">umwo want'hu wakaaga kulawa aho weli.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Kenege usekuutimila uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">masulumizo yako yaletigwa vileke unde hale nawo.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Kumbukila udahi wa Mnungu ivo wili mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">ni ani akudaha kumhiniza vedi enga yehe?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Ni ani akudaha kumgambila cha kudamanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">hegu kumgambila weye kubananga?<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Yehe atogolwa kwa kiya akudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">na yewe waungwa kumtogola.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Kila mnt'hu kayaona yadya adamanye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">mna chayaona kwa hale.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Mnungu kakulisa naho hakikudaha kummanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">hegu kuwaza miyaka yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Yehe ayaguha mazi mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">na kuyavuza yande mant'hwent'hwe ye fula.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Aitenda fula inye kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">na kuwanyeela want'hu wose.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Ni ani akumanya ivo mavunde yakugenda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">hegu lukuwa ivo lukunt'hint'hila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">kulawa mwo ulanga ukwo akwikala Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Yehe atenda lumwemwe kwenele mwo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">mna mwina we bahali wasigala ziza.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Kwa kukigaila fula nyingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">chapata nk'hande nyingi.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Akindila lumwemwe kwa mikono yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">na kuisigiila itowe hadya akuunga.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Lukua lwabwelekeza kwiza kwa fula nk'hulu ihagihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">hata mifugwa yamanya kugamba yeza.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Hayafanyanya ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:1">moyo wangu wazingiza kwa wogohi.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Nyuwe nyose tegelezeni izwi dya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">tegelezeni izwi enga lukuwa lukulawa mwo mnomo wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Yehe aleta lumwemwe mwo ulanga wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">naho lumwemwe lwakwe wenela mwe zint'hendelo zose ze isi.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Akajika izwi dyakwe dyevika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">izwi kulu dya lukuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">mwo lupisi lwose umwo anatint'hila lumwemwe lwa mweka.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Umwo Mnungu anatint'hila mbuli nk'hulu zalaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">mbuli za kwehela izo suwe hakikudaha kuzikombaganya.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Aigambila balafu, igwe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">nakuyagambila mant'hwent'he ye fula yanye,<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Akimalisa ndima zose za kila mnt'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">vileke want'hu wose wamanye ndima zakwe.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Makala ya kwe mbago nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">yauya mwe zimp'hanga zawe.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Nk'hung'unt'ho yalawaga mwe chumba chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">naho mp'heho yalawa mwe digulu dyakwe.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Kwa muye ywa Mnungu mazi yanda ya balafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">yahituka na kunda yatogile<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Ayamemeza mazi mwa mavunde, lumwemwe lwamweka kulawa mwe mavunde ayo,<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />yakagenda enga ivo akuunga Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">kulanga ye isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">na kudamanya dyodyose idyo akusigiila.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Mnungu ailagiza fula inye mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">naho adaha kuisigiila ikisengele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">hegu kulagisa lukunde lwakwe.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Ayubu hake goja naho utegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">fanyanya mbuli za kwehela izo akudamanya Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Togola wamanya ivo Mnungu akulava sigilizi yakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">na kulutenda lumwemwe mwe mwavunde?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Togola wamanya ivo mavunde yakuyeya kulanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Izo nizo ndima zedi za kwehela za Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Weye wahumwa ni fukuto itendese mwe zisuke zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">aho isi yanyamalaga haheina mp'heho ya kusini.<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Togola, wadaha kuzeneza mbingu hamwenga naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">na kuzitenda zitoga enga kilama kisanigwe?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Ayubu, kihinize cha kumgambila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">fanyanyi zetu hazina kint'hu, naho hakina dyo kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Miye hikugeza kulonga na Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">nnatenda ivo nazungula kubanika.<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Ivo hahana akudaha kudikaula zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">kwaivo dikung'ala kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">mp'heho ihagila ulanga.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Ung'azi wedi walaila kasikazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">Mnungu kagubikwa no ukulu wa kutisa.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Mnungu mta udahi hakikudaha kumsogeela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">Mnungu ni mta uwagilwa naho mhuwilwa mwe zindima zakwe.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Kwa ivo want'hu wose wamwogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">kwaviya yehe hakumkaula mnt'hu yeyose mta moyo mdala.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe amhitula Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Niho Zumbe Mnungu amhitulaga Ayubu kulawa mwe nk'hung'unt'ho, akagamba.<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />Nyuwe ni wahi mkuuza mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">kwa mbuli heziina kint'hu na za kihezi?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Utoge enga mgosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">name nenikuuze, na weye unihitule.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Nokundahi umwo haika nk'hongelo ze isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">Uneva kumanyisa hake nigambile neinda vivihi.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Niani aikile vihimo vakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Hegu achulule sigi ya kuhimila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Togola weye wamanya uhituzi wakwe?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Togola nk'hongelo yakwe yaikagwa mnanga ye mbwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">Hegu ni ani aikile iwe kulu dya nk'hongelo?<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />Mtondo wa zuwa idyo nt'hondo zakemaga hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">na viumbwa va kwe mbingu valavaga izwi kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />Niani aikile mihaka ye bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">hadya yatulikaga enga yalawa mwe zinda?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Ni miye niigubike ibahali kwa mavunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">na kuivugala mwe diziza.<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Miye ni miye naikilaga bahali mihaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">na kuikindila mwe zint'hendelo zakwe.<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />“Naigambaga uheelo wako ni aha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">aha niho mijubwaniso yako neiheele aha.”<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />Togola Ayubu mwo wikazi wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">ivo weye wandaga udigambe zuwa ditandazuke?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Togola wandaga uugambe ung'azi ugubike isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">Na kugulusa uwihi uhalawe hant'hu hakwe hakukefisa?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Ung'azi wa nomsi watenda vigulu na vizuto vaoneka pwilili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">enga suke ikebilinge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">yanda pwilili enga kiwalo mwe nyungu ya ulongo.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Ungazi wa nomsi kwa waihi hiyo wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">kwaviya wawakindila kudamanya uwihi.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />Togola wabulaga mwe zinc'hoko ze mina ye bahali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">Hegu kugenda ho mwina we bahali?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Togola waonaga nk'hili ze file?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">Hegu want'hu wombokaga hant'hu hana ziza dititihale?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Togola wamanya ukulu we isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">nigambile uneva kuyamanya aya yose.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Togola ukalo wo ung'azi ukuhi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">diziza nadyo dyakalahi?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Hegu wadaha kuulagisa ung'azi uite uhale wani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">Hegu kuuvuza uko ulaile?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Kindedi wamanya kwaviya weye ni mdala vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">nawe wandaga wiyuko umwo isi yaumbwagwa.<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Togola wengilaga mwe digulu dya balafu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">hegu kuona magulu ye fula ya maiwe?<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />Ivo naviika kwajili ya zuwa dya makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">naho kwajili ye dizuwa dya kutowana nk'hondo.<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Ikuhi sila ikuita mwe chotoko cho lumwemwe kudya ukupangwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">hegu mp'heho ya ulailo wa zuwa kudya ikwanjazwa?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Niani asimbile mikologombe kwajili ya mazi mengi ya fula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">na kuhagila isila kwajili yo lumwemwe,<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Niani akwitungula ifula hant'hu haheina want'hu wakwikala?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Niani akwitungula ifula he isi ye dijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">vileke mani yasuke?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Togola ifula hegu mnyuzu vina tati yawe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">Hegu niani atendile matwent'hwe ye fula?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Togola mami yawe dye balafu ne mp'heho niani?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Iyo ikuhitula mazi kunda maiwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">na kutoga mwe mnanga mwe bahali.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />Togola wadaha kulunganya hamwenga fyo dya nt'hondo za Kilimilwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">Hegu wadaha ukalohola sigi za Olioni?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Togola wadaha kuzilongoza nt'hondo mwe misimo yakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">Hegu wadaha kumlongoza kala dikwitangwa dubu na mwanawe?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Togola, wazimanya sigilizi zikulongoza kwe mbingu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">Togola sigilizi za kwe mbingu wadaha kuzitenda zilongoze isi?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Togola wadaha kuyabongeela mavunde kwo ulanga na kuyagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">mavunde yanye fula?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Hegu weye wadaha kuulagiza lumwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">naho wadaha kwiza kwako, “Kuusigiila ndima”?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Niani aikile mzungu kwa want'hu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">vileke abunk'hule mbuli kwa umanyi?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Ni ani mta ubala wa kudaha kuwaza mavunde?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">hegu ni ani akudaha kugidula mavunde vileke fula itike?<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />Fula iyo ikutenda luvumbi unde sanga itogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">na kutozana inde nt'hope.<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Togola wadaha kumzunguila simba nk'hande ya kudya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">vileke adye egute?<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />Umwo wakakefisa mwe zimp'hanga zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">hegu umwo wakanyatila mwe zimp'hanga zawe?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Ni ani akuwenk'ha kungulu nk'hande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">umwo wakangadika wakanda na sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">na wanawe wakaiila nk'hande?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />Togola wamanya ni lupisi luhi ngulugulu weleka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">Hegu wamanya ni lupisi luhi ngulugulu ikweleka wana?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Togola wadaha kuwaza miezi mpaka umwo weze weleke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">togola wamanya lupisi lwakwe ngulugulu lwa kweleka?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Togola wamanya ngulugulu lupisi lwawe lwa kufunama na kweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">na akajika aho usungu wa kweleka wasila.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Wanawe wagenyela na kupata ludole kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">akajika awaleka wamame zawe na kuita zawe.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Niani azilekele mp'hunda ya kwe mbago?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Ni ani azikomoele sigi zakwe?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Hizink'ha nyika kunda ukalo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">nyika zo munyu kunda ukalo wawe.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Zihale na vugo dya mwo mizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">naho hazikutegeleza lwasu lwa uyo akumdamanyila ndima.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Zagendagenda mwe vigulu kwajili ya kuzungula nk'hande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">na kuzungula kila kint'hu kibisi zidye.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Togola mbogo neisulumile kukudamanyila ndima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">Hegu neisulumile kwikala mwe didewa dyako?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Togola wadaha kuinyinya mbogo sigi vileke ilime nk'honde?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">Hegu neilime kunyuma kwako?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Togola nouihuwile kwaviya ina udahi mwingi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">na kuikawiila akudamanyile ndima zako ndala?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Togola nouihuwile kugamba neiktutikile ulozo wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">na kwigala nk'hande hant'hu ha kuhutila?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Mbuguni yatowatowa mawawa yakwe kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">mna haikudaha kupuluka enga nk'holongo.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Mbuguni yaleka matagi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">vileke yabwikane mwo msanga.<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Mna hamanyize kugamba yadaha kujatwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">hegu kutuligwa na makala ya kwe mbago.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Mbuguni yadaha kuwatendela wanawe vihile enga hiyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">yehe aona hi kint'hu ndima yakwe ikaga du.<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />Kwaviya miye Mnungu himtenda ande mhezi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">naho himwink'hile umanyi.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Mna umwo ikakonga kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">aihuma falasi hamwenga na uyo akugendeza b<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Togola ni weye uitendile falasi inde na ludole lutendese?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">na kuivika mwe singo mazoya matali mwe zisingo zawe?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Togola ni weye uzitendile falasi zipilike enga sige?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">na kuwatisa want'hu kwa kuila kwawe.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Kwa kinyemi zoho zakwangula kwangula hasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">zikagulukila kwe nk'hondo kwa udahi wawe wose,<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Falasi haikogoha chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">naho hakuuya kunyuma kwa kwogoha sime.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Vitowanilo wakuguha wakugendeza zifalasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">vahamizana umwo zili naho kung'ala mwe dizuwa.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Falasi yalongola kulongole ikazingiza kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">umwo magunda yakaila hazikudaha kukimala.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Kila umwo gunda dinatoigwa falasi yalava izwi dya kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">nayo yeva mp'hofa ya nk'hondo kulawa hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">yaiva izwi dya watowani wakulu wakalava sigilizi.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Togola mwewe kakehiniza kwako ivo akupilika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">na kuchulula mawawa yakwe kuhinga kusini?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Togola ni weye ukumsigiila sumula apilike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">na kuzenga chaila chakwe kulanga kwo mnima?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Sumula adamanya wikazi wakwe mwe maiwe ye kulanga vitendese</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">na mwo lunenengwa mwe dizuwe numwo mna gomela dyakwe.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Kulawa uko wakaula hale na hagihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">vileke apate nk'hande yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Wanawe wadya sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">aho handile ne kimba nuko eli sumula.<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Zumbe Mnungu agendeelaga kumgambila Ayubu. <verse eid="JOB 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />Togola ukei wagendeela kuhigana na miye Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Togola nouleke hegu nougendeele kuhitula.<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Niho Ayubu amhitula Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />Miye hi kint'hu nohitule mbwai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">naho henigeze kulonga chochose.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Nalongaga vitendese kujink'ha viya nahaungwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">nehitigiza mna henigendeele kulanga naho.<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Niho Zumbe Mnungu amhitulaga Ayubu kulawa mwe nk'hung'unt'ho.<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />Utoge kigosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">naho unihitule umwo hakuuza.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Togola weye walonga kugamba miye hiyo mlamuzi ywa kindedi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">Togola waunga kulagisa kugamba weye ni muwagilwa mna miye ni mta malema?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Togola weye una ludole enga miye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">Hegu izwi dyako dyadaha kulava izwi dya lukuwa enga ni miye?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Uneva wafanyanya kugamba wadaha ukayadamanya aya yose, lagisa ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">walagise want'hu wose udahi wako na ukulu wako.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Wakaule wose wana kitugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">itila maya yako na uwatende wakeseleze.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Mkaulise kila mta kitugu na umtende aseele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">naho uwahonde waihi hadya wakimale.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Uwamosele msanga wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">uwavugaile mwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Niho miye mwenye neninde ywa nk'hongo kukutunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">miye name nenizumile kugamba udahi wako mwenye zadaha kukuyokola.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Mkaulise yudya kiboko diya dikala dikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">miye hidiumba weye nawe hikuumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">mna yehe adya mani enga viya akudya ng'ombe.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Kaula, ludole lwakwe lumwe vigudi vakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">kaula udahi wakwe umwe mahinda ya nda yakwe.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Mkila wakwe wasingisika enga mti wa mwelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">viga vawe vikulu naho vitoga.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Mavuha yakwe ni enga mabomba ya shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">na viga vakwe vitoga enga kilama.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Dyoho ni dimwenga mwa makala ya nk'hongo mwe viumbwa vangu naviumbaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">ni miye nikedu hudaha kudihuma.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Yoho yadya mani yakunda mwe vigulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">ukwo nuko makala ya kwe mbago yakuseziga.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Dyagona hasi ye visaka maziti na miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">na kukefisa mwa madete ye mnk'handa mwa mazi.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Ahumula mwe zimp'heho che miti ina miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">na miti ikuhota mk'handa ye vizuto.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Umwo mto unamema dyoho hadikogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">hata uneva mto Yolodani yamemile mpaka kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">mna dyoho dyaona ni vedi du.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Niani akudaha kudigwila kudisita meso?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">hegu niani akudaha kugwila mp'hula yakwe mwo mtego?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />Togola wadaha kudilowa dikala dikulu dikwitangwa Lewiatani kwa nduwano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">Hegu kudinyinya lulimi lwakwe kwa sigi?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Togola wadaha kudigela sigi mwe mp'hula yakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">hegu kuponk'hola kwa nduwano mwe zinjeje zakwe.<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Togola Lewiatani naagendeele kukulombeza umuonele mbazi? Na kulonga na weye kwa ujalamu?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Togola naadamanye ndagano na weye vileke umguhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">ande mndima ywako mwo wikazi wako wose?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Togola nomnyinye enga dege dikufugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">enga kint'hu cha kuwabwedeza wana kike wako?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Togola wachuuzi nawasakanyane uchuuzi wawe kwajili yakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">hegu nawakepanganize mwa woho?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Togola wadaha kumduila mjungo na kuikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">hegu wadaha kutowa misale mwo mtwi wakwe?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Unamdosa nk'hanana imwenga houvuzagize naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">na hooujale naho iyo ink'hondo.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Yeyose akuiyona Lewiatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">aza ludole na kugwa hasi.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Hahana eli na udahi wa kumwinula Lewiatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">togola kuna yeyose mta udahi wa kunihiga naye?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Mwo mnomo wakwe kwalawa ndilija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">naho sese zo moto dalika kuse.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Nadaha kukugambila mbuli za viga va Lewiatani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">makiga yao yana ludole naho yawagila mwa meso.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Ni ani akudaha kuisangula nk'hingo yakwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">hegu akudaha kuiponk'hola?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Niani akudaha kwasamula mnomo we Lewiatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">meno yakwe yamtenda kila mnt'hu ogohe.<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Mgongo wakwe ni enga misafa ya nk'hindo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">magwalatu yakwe yatozona enga kilama naho hayakusingisika.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Kila nk'hindo ihagihi na iyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">hata mp'heho haikudaha komboka.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Zilunganywa hamwenga kwa kutoga kila yumwenga na miyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">naho zikeng'ang'anila kwa hamwenga naho hukudaha kuzipanganiza.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Dinatowa myasi kwanda na ung'azi wapuluikapulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">na meso yakwe yang'ala enga zuwa dikutotomoka.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Ndilija zakwe zikufosa kulawa mwo mnoma wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">na sese za moto zadaikila kuse,<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Mosi walawa mwe zip'hula zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">enga nk'huni ivo zikukweela hasi ye nyungu,<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Muye wakwe ni moto ukint'hile ukudaha kukweleza moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">naho ndilija za moto zalawa mwo mnomo wakwe.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Singo yakwe ina ludole lutendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">want'hu wadihogoha kokose uko dikuita.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Mahinda yo mwili wakwe iketozeleza kwa hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">nyama yakwe itoga naho haikuda kuusigwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Kifua chakwe kitoga enga iwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">naho hakikulegela ni enga iwe dya kusagila.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Umwo anakimala wata ludole wogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">wata ludole wauya kunyuma kwa wogofi,<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Haihali sime ikudaha kumlumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">hegu mjungo hegu msale hegu fumo.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Yehe aona kilama kunda enga zani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:27">na shaba enga mti uwoile.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Unamlasa yehe hakunyilike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:28">unamduila maiwe kwakwe ni enga mabunt'hi.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Lungu kwakwe ni enga mabunt'hi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:29">naho unamduila mjungu yehe aseka.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Zinda zakwe zina magwalatu enga vibesu va nyungu itulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">umwo zikuleka mbuluzo mwe nt'hope.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Ajubwanisa mina ya bahali enga nyungu ikutipwilika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:31">na kuikologa ibahali enga nyungu ya mavuta ya mhemp'he.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Umwo akomboka kunyuma yakwe aleka mbuluzo ukumetameta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:32">na mnt'hu akafanyanya kugamba mwina una fii.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Hahana chochose mwe isi kikuligana naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:33">yehe ni kiumbwa hekikogoha.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Yehe abela kila kala dina kitugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:34">yehe ni seuta wa makala yose ya kwe mbago.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Ayubu niyo amhitula Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />Namanya kugamba wadaha kudamanya mbuli zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">naho wadaha kudamanya chocho ukuunga.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Waniuzaga nii napelemba mzungu wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Kwaviya miye ni mhezi vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">nalongaga vint'hu hivimanyize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Mwe mbuli nyingi za kwehela hizimanyize.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />Wanigambaga nitegeleze umwo ukalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">naho nigeze kuhitula uhituzi wako.<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Kindedi nehinda hiva mbuli zako izo ulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">mna ivi haluse hiona kwa meso yangu mwenye.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Kwaivo naona soni kwa yadya nilongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">naho nakeseleza mwo luvumbi na kukeiila.<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zo uheelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Umwo Zumbe Mnungu eze abinde kulonga na Ayubu, amgambilaga Elifazi Mtemani, “Maya yangu yakweela mnanga mwako na mwa wambuya zako waidi kwaviya hamlongile kindedi mwangu enga mndima ywangu Ayubu ivo alongile. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Haluse elo guheni majeku mfungate na madolome mfungate mwite nayo kwa mndima ywangu Ayubu mkalave malavo yo kokwa kwajili yenyu. Naye mndima ywangu Ayubu naawalombezeleni, name nenive kulombeza kwawe naho heniwasengele enga ivo nomkaungwa. Kwaviya hamlongile kindedi mwangu enga mndima ywangu Ayubu ivo adamanye.”<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Ivo Elifazi Mtemani na Bilidadi Mshuhi na Sofali Mnaamati, wadamanyaga enga Zumbe Mnungu ivo awagambile, naye Zumbe Mnungu ayazumilaga malombezo ya Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Umwo Ayubu eze abinde kuwalombezela wambuyaze, Zumbe Mnungu amwink'haga Ayubu nk'hanana mbili kujink'ha ayo endile nayo nk'hongo. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Niho wanduguze wose wagosi kwa wavele na kila yumwenga ammanyize aho nk'hongo, wezaga niyo wadya hamwenga naye mwe nyumba yakwe. Wamsangalaza kwajili ya masulumizo yose ayo Zumbe Mnungu andaga kamwigaila. Kila yumwenga wawe amwink'haga Ayubu masawa na mp'hete ya zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Zumbe Mnungu aivikilaga miyaka itimile yo wikazi wa Ayubu kujink'ha idya ya nk'hongo. Andaga na ngoto alufu mlongo na kane na ngamia alufu mtandatu na majeku alufu mbili na mp'hunda alufu imwenga.<verse eid="JOB 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Naho andaga na wana kiliume mfungate na wana kike watatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Mwana kike ywa nk'hongo amwitangaga Yemima, ywa kaidi ni Kezia, ywa katatu Keleni Hapuki. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Mwe isi yose iyo hakwendile na wavele wedi enga wana kike wa Ayubu. Ise awenk'haga ukipe enga ivo awenk'hile wakuluze.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Ayo yeze yomboke, Ayubu ekelaga miyaka gana dimwenga na milongo mine, awaonaga wazukuluwe na vilembwe vakwe vose mpaka mwe cheleko cha kane. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Ivo Ayubu abanikaga akanda mdala wa miyaka mingi.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>